rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Can\'t target itself because you choose the target before you tap him. At that time he is not yet a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature is no longer tapped when the Assassin\'s ability resolves, then the ability doesn\'t resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have at least one of each of the three Urza\'s lands on the battlefield, you must take the 2 mana instead of just one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you tap City of Brass while you are casting a spell or activating an ability, its ability will trigger and wait. When you finish casting that spell or activating that ability, City of Brass\'s triggered ability is put on the stack on top of it. City of Brass\'s ability will resolve first."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'On the other hand, you can tap City of Brass, put its triggered ability on the stack, and then respond to that ability by casting an instant or activating an ability using that mana. In that case, the instant spell or activated ability will resolve first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The first ability triggers no matter how the land becomes tapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'A creature that must attack each turn, must only attack once that turn. It is not forced into each attack that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks, blocks, or is blocked will trigger during each combat that turn. Thus, a creature with Rampage will get the bonus added during each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you manage to cast this during a main phase of your opponent\'s turn, that opponent\'s creatures will untap and that opponent will be able to attack again. It will not allow you to attack during their turn."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only creates an additional combat and main phase if it resolves during a main phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'A source of damage is a permanent, a spell on the stack (including one that creates a permanent), or any object referred to by an object on the stack. A source doesn’t need to be capable of dealing damage to be a legal choice.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used even when there is no damage to prevent. It prevents the next damage (if any) from the source this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Alters all occurrences of the chosen word in the text box and the type line of the given card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target a card with no appropriate words on it, or even one with no words at all.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can be used to change a land’s type from one basic land type to another. For example, Forest can be changed to Island so it produces blue mana. It doesn’t change the name of any permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It can’t change a word to the same word. It must be a different word.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It only changes what is printed on the card (or set on a token when it was created or set by a copy effect). It will not change any effects that are on the permanent.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t change proper nouns (i.e. card names) such as “Island Fish Jasconius”.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the words to change on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Always affects the player and targets one of their opponents.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each point of damage is dealt separately, so if you are damaged twice by this spell, each time is considered a separate time this source deals damage.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card’s coin flip has no winner or loser.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Amount of damage is determined when the ability resolves and not when it is placed on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'An Aura put onto the battlefield this way does not target the permanent it is placed upon.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In multi-player games, it affects all players and players make choices in turn order.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Triggers from the permanents leaving the battlefield and then being put back onto the battlefield are not put on the stack until the entire effect is done.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t pick a card that can’t legally be returned to the battlefield. If there are no cards that can be legally returned, then you can’t pick one.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If you choose an Aura, you can put it on any permanent it can legally enchant. If there is nothing it can legally enchant, it remains exiled, and it can still be chosen by you or another player later in the auction. If there comes a point where only Auras and no legal permanents left, they stay exiled permanently.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You put the creature onto the battlefield, so you control it and any “enters the battlefield” abilities it has.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on a player with less than 2 cards in their library. It will remove 0 or 1 cards if that is all that is available.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is not a draw effect so it will not cause a player with less than 2 cards in their library to lose.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since you are putting more than one card in the graveyard at one time, the affected player can choose the order the 2 cards go in.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on artifact creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can bring back any enchantment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can sacrifice itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target an already tapped creature if you want.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Counterspells can be cast that target it, but when they resolve they simply don’t counter it since it can’t be countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Creatures are only put into a graveyard for having 0 toughness when state-based actions are checked. If Maro’s toughness goes to 0 during the announcement or resolution of a spell or ability and then goes back up above 0 before the end of that announcement or resolution, it won’t be put into your graveyard when state-based actions are checked.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Discarding as a cost to cast a spell will not trigger the ability. Only discarding as an effect will trigger the ability.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If it is discarded, the damage done by it is done by this card due to an ability and not by a spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The second ability will trigger even on an optional discard caused by an opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each other player sacrifices a creature for each creature you control that goes to a graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Gaining life is optional. If you forget, you can’t go back later even if it is something you usually do.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Howling Mine leaves the battlefield before it resolves, then the last known tap or untap state of the card is used for resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does not trigger at all if this is tapped at the start of the draw step, and it checks this again on resolution.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional draw is separate from any other draw during your draw step. It happens when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Sharing multiple creature types doesn\'t give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes more than one card to be drawn, draw the cards one at a time and deal with this replacement before drawing the next card.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If someone pays the cost, then the card was never drawn or discarded. It just gets put into the graveyard directly from the library.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a continuous replacement effect that modifies a draw.'}, {'date': '2006-04-01', 'text': 'When using Dredge with this, you have two choices. You can immediately replace the draw with Dredge, or you can apply Zur’s Weirding’s replacement. If the latter, you first resolve Zur’s Weirding’s ability, then if you’re going to draw the card, decide whether or not to replace that draw with Dredge.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell or ability damages multiple things, divide up the damage before applying this effect, and prevent the 1 damage to you only.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is a prevention effect applied when damage would be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a spell or ability damages multiple things, divide up the damage before applying this effect. This means you can’t normally end up with an odd amount of damage on something.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have two of these on the battlefield, the damage is multiplied by 4.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The multiplied damage counts in all ways as if it came from the original source. Furnace of Rath is not the source.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The trample rules cause damage to be divided before it is doubled.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage will be dealt, the player who would be dealt damage or the controller of the creature that would be dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Mending Hands says, “Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.” Suppose a spell would deal 5 damage to a player who has cast Mending Hands targeting themselves. That player can either (a) prevent 4 damage first and then let Furnace of Rath double the remaining 1 damage, taking 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 10 and then prevent 4 damage, taking 6 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If more than one creature damages it at one time, it only gets one counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple cards are drawn at once, this card triggers once for each card drawn.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'In a multi-player game, it affects all opponents.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at one time, this ability triggers once for each creature. This doesn’t matter much, but it can in some cases.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the Rukh Egg card is removed from the graveyard in the same turn it is put there, a Bird will still be put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If the Egg is destroyed while under the control of another player, the controller of the Egg gets the Bird.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'If the Egg is exiled instead of being put into the graveyard, no Bird is put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2005-10-01', 'text': 'Text-changing effects can be used to change the color of the Bird that will be put onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the player has no cards in their library, the effect does nothing. It does not cause any damage.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The target player names a card on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If there is no other legal target for the spell, this does not change the target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Once the spell resolves, the new target is considered to be targeted by the deflected spell. This will trigger any effects which trigger on being targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The target of a spell that targets another spell on the stack can be changed to any other spell on the stack, even if the new target will resolve before the spell does.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This does not check if the current target is legal. It just checks if the spell has a single target.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This only targets the spell being changed, not the original or new target of the spell it is affecting.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can choose to make a spell on the stack target this spell (if such a target choice would be legal had the spell been cast while this spell was on the stack). The new target for the deflected spell is not chosen until this spell resolves. This spell is still on the stack when new targets are selected for the spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t make a spell which is on the stack target itself.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the spell to target on announcement, but you pick the new target for that spell on resolution.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets multiple things, you can’t target it with Deflection, even if all but one of those targets has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2009-02-01', 'text': 'If a spell targets the same player or object multiple times, you can’t target it with Deflection.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you are damaged by more than one, the effects are cumulative and you skip multiple combat phases.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these, each effect triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do your normal draw before this ability is put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It affects Elves controlled by all players, not just yours.'}, {'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'This card is now an Elf but has been reworded so that it does not give itself the bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does give the land a color and creature type, which is unlike most other ways to animate a land.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This can be placed on any land, not just Forests.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is returned to its owner’s hand at the end of any turn in which it is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It reduces your life total to 1, not the damage to 1.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Worship does not prevent damage. It causes some damage to be unable to lower your life total. So any damage rendered useless by Worship was still dealt and is counted by effects that track the amount of damage done to a player. In addition, Worship does not prevent loss of life, so loss of life bypasses Worship.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Regenerating artifacts can regenerate from this.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability applies to your opponent’s spells as well as your own.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The additional cost can be reduced by effects that reduce costs, such as Sapphire Medallion.\'}, {\'date\': \'2006-05-01\', \'text\': "In Two-Headed Giant, spells don\'t cost extra on your own turn."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The color is chosen on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature being brought back is chosen on announcement and not on resolution of the spell because it is targeted.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You must show the card you bring out of the graveyard to your opponent.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creatures are counted on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The decision whether or not to tap or untap is made on resolution. This is not a modal spell.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is not a toggle effect. If you use Twiddle to tap a card and before it takes effect your opponent taps it, Twiddle will not automatically untap the card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {W}{W} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The number of cards is counted during resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The owner decides the order the two lands are stacked there.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The power of the creature is checked on activation and on resolution. If the targeted creature’s power is not 4 or greater on resolution, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The spell’s controller gets the option to pay when this ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card can trigger on itself being returned to a player’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability. It does not go on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Triggers once per creature, not once per point of damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast this if you have less than 3 life, since the life is lost as an effect and not a payment.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can use it on yourself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You decide on resolution whether or not to tap or untap the creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not take the 3 points of damage if the ability doesn’t resolve because the target is illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You don’t draw a card if this spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You draw one card per creature, not one per point of damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Goblin King now has the Goblin creature type and its ability has been reworded to affect *other* Goblins. This means that if two Goblin Kings are on the battlefield, each gives the other a bonus.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Lord of the Undead now has the Zombie creature type and its first ability has been reworded to affect *other* Zombies. This means that if two Lord of the Undead are on the battlefield, each gives the other a bonus.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': \'Putting the card onto the battlefield is optional. When the ability resolves, you can choose not to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A "creature card" is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type Creature, even if it has other types such as Artifact or Enchantment. Older cards of type Summon are also Creature spells.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you control 0 swamps, then the Nightmare has 0 toughness and will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action right before the next player gains priority.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s power and toughness changes as the number of Swamps you control changes.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Nightmare’s ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that defines Nightmare’s power and toughness works everywhere, not just on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Since the activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap a creature (including Llanowar Behemoth itself) that hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now has Enchant Swamp, which works exactly like any other Enchant ability. This means it can only be cast targeting a Swamp, and it will be put into its owner’s graveyard if the permanent it’s attached to ever stops being a Swamp.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Spellbook onto the battlefield, you’ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents entered the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'"You" refers to the controller of Curiosity, which may be different from the controller of the enchanted creature. "An opponent" refers to an opponent of Curiosity\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Any damage dealt by the enchanted creature to an opponent will cause Curiosity to trigger, not just combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "Curiosity doesn\'t trigger if the enchanted creature deals damage to a planeswalker or to a battle."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': "If you control Curiosity and it\'s enchanting an opponent\'s creature, you won\'t draw a card when that creature deals damage to you. The creature has to deal damage to one of your opponents for the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2023-09-01\', \'text\': \'You draw one card each time the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, no matter how much damage it deals.\'}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If an effect creates a copy of Pyrotechnics, the number of targets and division of damage can’t be changed. The effect that creates the copy may allow you to change the targets, however.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If some but not all of Pyrotechnics’s targets become illegal, you can’t change the division of damage. Damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets simply isn’t dealt.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You choose how the damage is divided as you cast the spell, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'All creatures on the battlefield when Nausea resolves are affected. Ones that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn are not.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Emperor Crocodile’s ability will trigger if you don’t control another creature, even if it’s only for a brief moment during the resolution of another spell or ability (such as that of Brago, King Eternal).'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'The ability only checks if you control no other creatures at the time it triggers. It does not check again on resolution, so gaining control of a creature before then will not save Emperor Crocodile.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Nothing happens if there are no nonartifact, nonblack creatures on the battlefield when Nekrataal enters the battlefield, but if there is one, you must target it, even if it’s a creature you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'As blockers are declared, any creature that’s tapped or affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having the creature block, no player is forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t block if that cost isn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Lure doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If a basic land you control gains another basic land type or gains another ability that lets it produce mana, consider those effects when determining what colors of mana that land can produce.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Colorless is a type but not a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If blocked by a creature with banding, the defending player decides whether or not the damage is assigned “as though it weren’t blocked”.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker this creature is attacking. You can’t split the damage assignment between them.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can decide to assign damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or damage preventing effects on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw cards and then discard cards, you can’t take actions in between. For example, if you have no cards in hand and cast Faithless Looting, you can’t activate Seismic Assault’s ability between the time you draw two cards and discard those two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player loses the game, triggered abilities that player controls are removed from the stack and no more from that player can be added. This means that if a creature an opponent controls dies while you control Fecundity, and you lose the game before Fecundity’s triggered ability resolves (perhaps because you lost the game at the same time that the creature died), that player won’t draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the spell is an illegal target when Rewind tries to resolve, perhaps because it was countered by another spell or ability, Rewind won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t untap any lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Rewind targets only a spell. It doesn\'t target any lands. The lands are chosen as Rewind resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can choose up to four lands, no matter who controls any of them. Those lands untap once. You can\'t choose one land and have it untap four times, for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Ensnaring Bridge\'s effect checks the number of cards in your hand only while a player (including you) is declaring attackers. Once a creature has legally attacked, changing its power or the number of cards in your hand won\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it can apply. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply "as" a land enters the battlefield, such as the first ability of Cavern of Souls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers "when" it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Nonbasic lands will lose any other land types and abilities they had. They will gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability "{T}: Add {R}."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'This effect doesn\\\'t affect names or supertypes. It won\\\'t turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won\\\'t be named "Mountain."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures of the chosen type may become lethal if Brass Herald leaves the battlefield during that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The choice of creature type is made as Brass Herald enters the battlefield. Players can\'t take any actions between the time the choice is made and the time the appropriate creatures begin to get +1/+1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. You could even choose Coward, if you dared. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a permanent doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "Gaining control of an Aura or Equipment doesn\'t change what it\'s attached to."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The triggered ability triggers when the enchanted creature deals any damage, not only combat damage.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Unlike the lifelink ability, the ability of Spirit Link is a triggered ability that goes on the stack and may be responded to. Notably, if the enchanted creature deals damage at the same time you’re dealt enough damage to reduce your life total to 0 or less, you’ll lose the game before you can gain any life.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Ketos\' Zauberbuch", \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist Macht." —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955d0532-433b-47b6-82b5-95e45394acc0\', \'multiverseId\': 162919}, \'multiverseid\': 162919}, {\'name\': \'Volumen de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El conocimiento es poder." —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741eb883-b45f-481d-9abb-58b48cbad212\', \'multiverseId\': 165556}, \'multiverseid\': 165556}, {\'name\': \'Grimoire de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Savoir, c\'est pouvoir. » —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163276&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fdf50b7-95eb-4952-8d6b-d5b60dbc2828\', \'multiverseId\': 163276}, \'multiverseid\': 163276}, {\'name\': \'Tomo di Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La conoscenza è potere". —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d08ba37-a665-4cc2-ac50-38fa39d1709a\', \'multiverseId\': 165199}, \'multiverseid\': 165199}, {\'name\': \'ジェイムデー秘本\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6bf3f96-4814-4c31-b1c1-78a2b21c11ad\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Livro de Jayemdae\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Conhecimento é poder." —Sir Francis Bacon, Meditationes Sacrae\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f71da89-1e75-4728-abbe-dae33f612d82\', \'multiverseId\': 165913}, \'multiverseid\': 165913}]', "[{'name': 'Aasmauer', 'text': '(Mauern können nicht angreifen.)\\n{1}{B}: Regeneriere die Aasmauer', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mauer', 'flavor': 'Für eine Mauer aus Leichenteilen wird es in Kriegszeiten niemals an Baumaterial fehlen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162734&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b15cd3f9-c0f5-409e-916c-366f91ccf4ec', 'multiverseId': 162734}, 'multiverseid': 162734}, {'name': 'Muro de carroña', 'text': '(Los Muros no pueden atacar.)\\n{1}{B}: Regenera al Muro de carroña.', 'type': 'Criatura — Muro', 'flavor': 'A un muro hecho con los cuerpos del enemigo nunca le faltará material de construcción en tiempos de guerra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165371&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7cb43b04-9b33-4de2-9055-f5963f6b8690', 'multiverseId': 165371}, 'multiverseid': 165371}, {'name': 'Mur de charogne', 'text': '(Les murs ne peuvent pas attaquer.)\\n{1}{B} : Régénérez le Mur de charogne.', 'type': 'Créature : mur', 'flavor': 'En tant de guerre, rien de plus simple que de bâtir un mur avec des cadavres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163091&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb891f09-b6f7-4dec-bcfb-5a6ddd063866', 'multiverseId': 163091}, 'multiverseid': 163091}, {'name': 'Muro di Carogne', 'text': '(I Muri non possono attaccare.)\\n{1}{B}: Rigenera il Muro di Carogne.', 'type': 'Creatura — Muro', 'flavor': 'Un muro eretto con i corpi dei nemici non mancherà mai di materia prima in tempo di guerra.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165014&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '202c946f-f15e-4c9a-b82a-2f25560e0c2d', 'multiverseId': 165014}, 'multiverseid': 165014}, {'name': '屍肉の壁', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '188dc12e-22ff-43a1-a934-9ecc33ef0250'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Barreira de Podridão', 'text': '(As Barreiras não podem atacar.)\\n{1}{B}: Regenera Barreira de Podridão.', 'type': 'Criatura — Barreira', 'flavor': 'Em tempos de guerra, nunca falta material para uma muralha construída com os cadáveres do inimigo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165728&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9da50eb-c7a3-4d1e-a816-621238aa2a24', 'multiverseId': 165728}, 'multiverseid': 165728}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abknöpfen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft dieser Spieler eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Gelegenheit macht Diebe. —Römisches Sprichwort\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162752&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a78a66-39ad-48eb-a183-182aac1e068b\', \'multiverseId\': 162752}, \'multiverseid\': 162752}, {\'name\': \'Latrocinio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controles haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador descarta una carta de su mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La tentación hace al ladrón. —Proverbio romano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabea312-c91f-4281-8670-f93d7eb9f1ec\', \'multiverseId\': 165389}, \'multiverseid\': 165389}, {\'name\': \'Larcin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur se défausse d\'une carte de sa main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les honnêtes gens ne demandent qu\'à devenir voleurs. » — Sacha Guitry", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80377362-d538-4844-b8f3-0e7f83938304\', \'multiverseId\': 163109}, \'multiverseid\': 163109}, {\'name\': \'Latrocinio\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore scarta una carta dalla propria mano.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "L\'opportunità rende l\'uomo ladro. —proverbio latino", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f72ae5-301d-40d5-9160-92f1f35b8ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 165032}, \'multiverseid\': 165032}, {\'name\': \'窃盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d119dc22-e5ad-4a41-b533-a1325f97acd3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Furto\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador descarta um card de sua própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A ocasião faz o ladrão. — Provérbio romano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab0f86bf-6758-4c8e-936c-145b32299d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 165746}, \'multiverseid\': 165746}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ablenkung\', \'text\': \'Verändere das Ziel eines Zauberspruches deiner Wahl, der nur ein einzelnes Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die goldene Regel für Rache: Füg anderen zu, was sie dir antun wollten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ad9b4d-7e17-46ab-9e5a-b161b9f238c0\', \'multiverseId\': 162687}, \'multiverseid\': 162687}, {\'name\': \'Redirigir\', \'text\': \'Cambia el objetivo de un hechizo objetivo que tenga un solo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La regla de oro de la venganza: hazles a otros lo que ellos intentaron hacerte a ti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84d63c7a-7b86-44ec-a2ef-2f7b7d584110\', \'multiverseId\': 165324}, \'multiverseid\': 165324}, {\'name\': \'Déflexion\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une nouvelle cible pour le sort ciblé qui a une cible unique.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La règle d\'or de la vengeance : faites à votre prochain ce qu\'il voulait vous faire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4e88b2-5932-4c3a-8ba0-1bc7b465667f\', \'multiverseId\': 163044}, \'multiverseid\': 163044}, {\'name\': \'Deflettere\', \'text\': \'Cambia il bersaglio di una magia bersaglio con un singolo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "La regola d\'oro della vendetta: fai agli altri quello che hanno tentato di fare a te.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0da27553-f4ba-4236-99ba-b63ecc693757\', \'multiverseId\': 164967}, \'multiverseid\': 164967}, {\'name\': \'偏向\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46aa6096-ac7d-4233-8982-e136bf4a5500\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Deflexão\', \'text\': \'Escolha um novo alvo para a mágica alvo que visa um único alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A regra de ouro da vingança: Faz aos outros o que eles tentaram fazer a ti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7925397f-d183-425b-ba4f-2fbf4cb063b0\', \'multiverseId\': 165681}, \'multiverseid\': 165681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aladins Ring\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Aladins Ring fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ha, Männer Seht, der feine Knabe trägt ja Schmuck ..." —Wüstenräuber, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b47ea36-3010-4f8b-aa8f-c0b5c84c1ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 162904}, \'multiverseid\': 162904}, {\'name\': \'Anillo de Aladino\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: El Anillo de Aladino hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una lámpara buena iluminará tu camino. Un anillo bueno lo despejará." —Nervan, joyero real\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'200b178b-04da-4e62-94ea-d6b872440a56\', \'multiverseId\': 165541}, \'multiverseid\': 165541}, {\'name\': "Anneau d\'Aladdin", \'text\': "{8}, {T} : L\'Anneau d\'Aladdin inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Une bonne lampe éclairera votre chemin. Un bon anneau vous nettoiera le chemin » —Argot gobelin pour « M\'as-tu vu. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163261&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea267d34-6a2d-469d-a825-5d54df8cd20a\', \'multiverseId\': 163261}, \'multiverseid\': 163261}, {\'name\': \'Anello di Aladino\', \'text\': "{8}, {T}: L\'Anello di Aladino infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una buona lampada illuminerà il tuo cammino. Un buon anello spazzerà via gli ostacoli." —Nervan, gioielliere reale\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a018183b-c5ed-45ac-8672-1234fc1b859c\', \'multiverseId\': 165184}, \'multiverseid\': 165184}, {\'name\': \'アラジンの指輪\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e79169c-4d67-408c-a716-e3876ce0a41f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anel de Aladim\', \'text\': \'{8}, {T}: Anel de Aladim causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma boa lâmpada iluminará teu caminho. Um bom anel o limpará." — Nervan, joalheiro da realeza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c4761c-b4e8-4a81-918b-d2096df87219\', \'multiverseId\': 165898}, \'multiverseid\': 165898}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alarmwache\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen enttappen nicht während der Enttappsegmente ihrer Besitzer.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, enttappe alle Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Schritt unter tausend ist unhörbar. Ein Schritt alleine ist ohrenbetäubend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162699&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fedeb19-ab1b-4d9e-a8b8-6321154090d8\', \'multiverseId\': 162699}, \'multiverseid\': 162699}, {\'name\': \'Alarma contra intrusos\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no se enderezan durante los pasos de enderezar de sus controladores.\\nSiempre que una criatura entre en juego, endereza todas las criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Una pisada entre muchas es silenciosa. Una pisada sola es ensordecedora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7df5b641-27e5-458b-91d7-8fbf8ce2c069\', \'multiverseId\': 165336}, \'multiverseid\': 165336}, {\'name\': "Signal d\'alarme", \'text\': "Les créatures ne se dégagent pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de leurs contrôleurs.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive en jeu, dégagez toutes les créatures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Un pas parmi tant d\'autres est silencieux. Un pas solitaire est assourdissant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fedc2ee-12d8-4b3a-96ac-4f2dbdcc1c80\', \'multiverseId\': 163056}, \'multiverseid\': 163056}, {\'name\': \'Allarme Anti-intruso\', \'text\': \'Le creature non STAPpano durante lo STAP dei loro controllori.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura entra in gioco, STAPpa tutte le creature.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Un passo tra molti non fa alcun rumore. Un passo da solo è assordante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526129ca-d052-4125-b8a9-ff61a6d5ea56\', \'multiverseId\': 164979}, \'multiverseid\': 164979}, {\'name\': \'侵入警報\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda59b8e-7f18-4977-8408-1b5f619a5335\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Alarme de Intrusos\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não desviram durante as etapas de desvirar de seus controladores.\\nToda vez que uma criatura entrar em jogo, desvire todas as criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Um passo entre muitos é silencioso. Um passo isolado é ensurdecedor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47048ae8-4c3a-4a34-95ee-b12b2f9bcb1b\', \'multiverseId\': 165693}, \'multiverseid\': 165693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Algenteppich\', \'text\': \'Der Algenteppich kann nur einen Sumpf verzaubern.\\nWenn das verzauberte Land getappt wird, zerstöre es.\\nWenn der Algenteppich in einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Algenteppich auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Landverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f402dfd0-f857-47a1-a7cb-789577d1bbcd\', \'multiverseId\': 162894}, \'multiverseid\': 162894}, {\'name\': \'Algas propagantes\', \'text\': \'Las Algas propagantes sólo pueden encantar a un Pantano.\\nCuando la tierra encantada sea girada, destruye esa tierra.\\nCuando las Algas propagantes vayan a un cementerio desde el juego, regresa las Algas propagantes a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantar tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5441a22-11d1-404d-8b63-7d5383fa7273\', \'multiverseId\': 165531}, \'multiverseid\': 165531}, {\'name\': \'Algue envahissante\', \'text\': "L\'Algue envahissante ne peut enchanter qu\'un marais.\\nQuand le terrain enchanté devient engagé, détruisez-le.\\nQuand l\'Algue envahissante est mise dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, renvoyez l\'Algue envahissante dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163251&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eabe963-3b87-41c7-ac5a-1cb3d023d817\', \'multiverseId\': 163251}, \'multiverseid\': 163251}, {\'name\': \'Alghe Prolifere\', \'text\': \'Le Alghe Prolifere possono incantare solo una Palude.\\nQuando la terra incantata viene TAPpata, distruggi quella terra.\\nQuando le Alghe Prolifere vengono messe in un cimitero dal gioco, il proprietario riprende in mano le Alghe Prolifere.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224d03d2-aabe-4a22-8f73-3720b5b1d638\', \'multiverseId\': 165174}, \'multiverseid\': 165174}, {\'name\': \'藻の蔓延\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b27d26-7ef5-4617-ab7a-02fa98119544\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Algas Disseminadas\', \'text\': \'Algas Disseminadas só pode encantar um Pântano.\\nQuando o terreno encantado for virado, destrua aquele terreno.\\nQuando Algas Disseminadas for colocado em um cemitério vindo de jogo, devolva Algas Disseminadas para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23255b20-ad85-40a4-b732-0dc934a44a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 165888}, \'multiverseid\': 165888}]', "[{'name': 'Anaba-Schamane', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Der Anaba-Schamane fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Minotaurus', 'flavor': 'Versuche mal, diesen Stier bei den Hörnern zu packen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162788&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ae815e0-a21e-4e8c-83ee-496d89a056ce', 'multiverseId': 162788}, 'multiverseid': 162788}, {'name': 'Chamán de Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: El Chamán de Anaba hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Minotauro', 'flavor': 'Sólo intenta tomar a este toro por los cuernos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165425&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd99e36cd-186f-4aea-81b7-032f4f9c58ad', 'multiverseId': 165425}, 'multiverseid': 165425}, {'name': 'Shaâmane anabaane', 'text': '{R}, {T} : Le Shaâmane anabaane inflige une blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature : minotaure', 'flavor': 'Essayez donc de prendre ce taureau par les cornes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163145&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bc98779-696b-48be-9a26-95fc00e21716', 'multiverseId': 163145}, 'multiverseid': 163145}, {'name': 'Sciamano di Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Lo Sciamano di Anaba infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Minotauro', 'flavor': 'Prova a prendere questo toro per le corna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165068&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da5fbc2a-51fb-4e99-bdf3-8b3e32d12fe5', 'multiverseId': 165068}, 'multiverseid': 165068}, {'name': 'アナーバのシャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fcf91a3-a292-4b44-9fd7-23dae2c2599a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Xamã de Anaba', 'text': '{R}, {T}: Xamã de Anaba causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Minotauro', 'flavor': 'Tente pegar este touro pelos chifres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165782&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4872c2e-0e1c-4f6b-a17e-626b0bd3b2a4', 'multiverseId': 165782}, 'multiverseid': 165782}]", '[{\'name\': \'Anbetung\', \'text\': \'Wenn du eine Kreatur kontrollierst, reduziert aller Schaden, der deine Lebenspunkte auf weniger als 1 reduzieren würde, stattdessen deine Lebenspunkte auf 1.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Glaube an das Ideal, nicht an das Idol." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f03af1d5-1f8d-4454-8c20-63f65d4310ab\', \'multiverseId\': 162670}, \'multiverseid\': 162670}, {\'name\': \'Adoración\', \'text\': \'Si controlas una criatura, el daño que fuera a reducir tu total de vida a menos de 1, en vez de eso, lo reduce a 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Cree en el ideal, no en el ídolo."—Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2578d450-517c-4866-a9ea-abc6dd3f3e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 165307}, \'multiverseid\': 165307}, {\'name\': \'Adoration\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez au moins une créature, les blessures qui devraient réduire votre total de points de vie à moins de 1 le réduisent à 1 à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Croyez en l\'idéal, pas en l\'idole. » —Serra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9630a1-b2bd-4734-aaf7-da35d88edb6a\', \'multiverseId\': 163027}, \'multiverseid\': 163027}, {\'name\': \'Adorare\', \'text\': \'Se controlli almeno una creatura, qualsiasi danno che ridurrebbe il totale dei tuoi punti vita a meno di 1 lo riduce invece a 1.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Credi nell\\\'ideale, non nell\\\'idolo." —Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7064623-5e34-412a-b782-9c59c0eb74a0\', \'multiverseId\': 164950}, \'multiverseid\': 164950}, {\'name\': \'崇拝\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240e75fa-4e82-489b-b538-58ccc070fe39\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Adoração\', \'text\': \'Se você controlar uma criatura, o dano que reduziria seu total de pontos de vida para menos do que 1, em vez disso, o reduzirá para 1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tenha fé no ideal, não no ídolo." — Serra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d286ae0-9fbd-4948-a74e-708a9cecba8e\', \'multiverseId\': 165664}, \'multiverseid\': 165664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archivar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Macht wechselt häufiger von Hand zu Hand als von Kopf zu Kopf." —Stanislaw Jerzy Lec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'467d5008-5c02-4c5d-a65e-d0f84e9f1661\', \'multiverseId\': 162673}, \'multiverseid\': 162673}, {\'name\': \'Archivero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero\', \'flavor\': \'"Las palabras. Cuán inocentes e impotentes son en el diccionario. ¡Cuán poderosas se vuelven, para bien o para mal, para alguien que sabe combinarlas" —Nathaniel Hawthorne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e39cc92-a28b-42bf-b453-65542f69c0c3\', \'multiverseId\': 165310}, \'multiverseid\': 165310}, {\'name\': \'Archiviste\', \'text\': \'{T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Fouiller dans les archives de l\'antiquité pour en retirer des choses échappées aux esprits les plus curieux. » —La Bruyère", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89cd7a94-791d-4e7d-94c1-ec8bd78b43dc\', \'multiverseId\': 163030}, \'multiverseid\': 163030}, {\'name\': \'Archivista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca una carta\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Parole: così innocenti e innocue quando si trovano in un dizionario, tanto potenti nel bene e nel male per chi sa come fonderle" —Nathaniel Hawthorne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0b7370-cf65-436a-920b-f70838af6061\', \'multiverseId\': 164953}, \'multiverseid\': 164953}, {\'name\': \'文書管理人\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3d5eea-b117-431c-baa7-f6d96f73591e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arquivista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Palavras tão inocentes e inócuas quando isoladas num dicionário; quão poderosas elas se tornam, para o bem ou para o mal, na boca daqueles que sabem combiná-las" — Nathaniel Hawthorne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d92d12-b475-4ff7-b730-a9c8b2695cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 165667}, \'multiverseid\': 165667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Armbrustträger\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der Armbrustträger fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Er kann über das halbe Schlachtfeld hinweg eine Sumpffliege in zwei Teile zerlegen." —Oneanischer Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972a07f2-139a-4ea3-a7f9-3869c66d0d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 162628}, \'multiverseid\': 162628}, {\'name\': \'Infantería de ballesta\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Infantería de ballesta hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede partir a una mosca del pantano en dos desde la mitad del campo de tiro."—Sargento oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291427be-8ad5-4471-aee4-c122b92b9a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 165265}, \'multiverseid\': 165265}, {\'name\': \'Arbalétriers à pied\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ces Arbalétriers à pied infligent 1 blessure à la créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Il peut couper en deux une mouche des marais qui traverse le champ de tir. » — Un sergent onéan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f6f7ad-86d6-454b-9cca-e6d4c27e3a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 162985}, \'multiverseid\': 162985}, {\'name\': \'Fante Balestriere\', \'text\': \'{T}: Il Fante Balestriere infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio che sta attaccando o bloccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato\', \'flavor\': \'"Può dividere in due una mosca delle paludi anche alla massima distanza." —Sergente oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9641cf5-d919-4dd2-84ee-57279e2b3799\', \'multiverseId\': 164908}, \'multiverseid\': 164908}, {\'name\': \'弩弓歩兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a8a02c9-ec98-4710-8ae4-795177a9895f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Infantaria com Balista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Infantaria com Balista causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele é capaz de partir uma mosca ao meio, na metade do alcance." — Sargento de Oneah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8be021d-7f8e-4e6a-98e1-4d1a36272807\', \'multiverseId\': 165622}, \'multiverseid\': 165622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Artefaktdiebstahl\', \'text\': \'Du kontrollierst das verzauberte Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcafe70f-2181-4c65-9553-76a4e499200b\', \'multiverseId\': 162716}, \'multiverseid\': 162716}, {\'name\': \'Robar artefacto\', \'text\': \'Tú controlas el artefacto encantado.\', \'type\': \'Encantar artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a002663-833f-4180-b9ec-633c94d1b7bc\', \'multiverseId\': 165353}, \'multiverseid\': 165353}, {\'name\': "Vol d\'artefact", \'text\': "Vous contrôlez l\'artefact enchanté.", \'type\': \'Enchanter : artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'076f5bfb-0064-4130-bee2-1e33ca1a7a0b\', \'multiverseId\': 163073}, \'multiverseid\': 163073}, {\'name\': \'Rubare Artefatto\', \'text\': "Controlli l\'artefatto incantato.", \'type\': \'Incanta Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e0084a-afad-4fda-a935-cbd829a1ac90\', \'multiverseId\': 164996}, \'multiverseid\': 164996}, {\'name\': \'秘宝奪取\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d696231a-4b72-40ac-a903-3d6597cb39cf\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Roubar Artefato\', \'text\': \'Você controla o artefato encantado.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed1cbee-0cb1-4927-a1ec-157f071ed92e\', \'multiverseId\': 165710}, \'multiverseid\': 165710}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschenmauer\', \'text\': \'(Mauern können nicht angreifen.)\\nWenn die Aschenmauer blockt, zerstöre sie am Ende des Kampfes.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Geruch nach verbranntem Fleisch hing noch für Stunden über dem Tal." —Oneanischer Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792f7c22-2266-4892-baec-11bbbc592ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 162795}, \'multiverseid\': 162795}, {\'name\': \'Muro de cenizas\', \'text\': \'(Los Muros no pueden atacar.)\\nCuando el Muro de cenizas bloquee, destrúyelo al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"El olor de carne quemada flotó sobre el valle durante horas".—Sargento oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72cfb46c-d044-4657-9230-b74272c289f7\', \'multiverseId\': 165432}, \'multiverseid\': 165432}, {\'name\': \'Mur de cendres\', \'text\': \'(Les murs ne peuvent pas attaquer.)\\nQuand le Mur de cendres bloque, détruisez-le à la fin du combat.\', \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': "« L\'odeur de la chair brûlée flotta sur la vallée pendant plusieurs heures. » — Un sergent onéan", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'027663db-be06-439d-8dee-8b2b478c39fc\', \'multiverseId\': 163152}, \'multiverseid\': 163152}, {\'name\': \'Muro di Cenere\', \'text\': \'(I Muri non possono attaccare.)\\nQuando il Muro di Cenere blocca, distruggilo alla fine del combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'odore di carne bruciata rimase a infestare la valle per ore". —Sergente oneano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55bd6663-24c1-415a-a76a-b98831d021d4\', \'multiverseId\': 165075}, \'multiverseid\': 165075}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの壁\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406f7b7a-5df8-48af-a93e-44a2bb2fd668\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Barreira de Brasas\', \'text\': \'(As Barreiras não podem atacar.)\\nQuando Barreira de Brasas bloquear, destrua-a no final do combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'"O cheiro de carne assada pairou sobre o vale por horas." — Sargento de Oneah\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f736ea41-e597-438d-87ab-2302fbbd98d8\', \'multiverseId\': 165789}, \'multiverseid\': 165789}]', "[{'name': 'Auferstehung der Toten', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Was durch Magie befehligt wird, kann die Erde nicht festhalten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162770&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '684f809c-b6d0-47c5-9c87-5b0ce22e2610', 'multiverseId': 162770}, 'multiverseid': 162770}, {'name': 'Alzar a los muertos', 'text': 'Regresa la carta objetivo de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'La tierra no puede contener aquello que la magia rige.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165407&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6544643c-9b95-48e2-8e50-ae299a69da3c', 'multiverseId': 165407}, 'multiverseid': 165407}, {'name': 'Exhumation', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Terre ne peut garder ce que magie réclame.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163127&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7644952-d97a-436f-a34f-3626d244eae5', 'multiverseId': 163127}, 'multiverseid': 163127}, {'name': 'Risveglio dei Morti', 'text': 'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'La terra non può trattenere ciò che è governato dalla magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165050&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08ab57a7-1a85-4c04-ba62-870dd597aff1', 'multiverseId': 165050}, 'multiverseid': 165050}, {'name': '死者再生', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '456649dc-c66a-4025-ae20-0d1ed11dd875'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ressuscitar Morto', 'text': 'Devolve o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'A terra não pode reter o que a magia comanda.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165764&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1107603-7594-4563-8955-272ddcb53cb2', 'multiverseId': 165764}, 'multiverseid': 165764}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aufreißender Himmel\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Farbe, sowie der Aufreißende Himmel ins Spiel kommt.\\nAlle bleibenden Karten außer Ländern haben diese Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Beherrsche den Himmel, und du regierst alles, was darunter ist. —Redewendung der Metathran\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27337622-9b0d-4f63-8d20-b3604794ec25\', \'multiverseId\': 162713}, \'multiverseid\': 162713}, {\'name\': \'Cielo cambiante\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Cielo cambiante entre en juego, elige un color.\\nTodos los permanentes que no sean tierra son del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Domina el cielo y gobernarás todo lo que haya bajo él. Refrán metathrán\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0342829-08f4-4580-9b75-7ca4510cf4f9\', \'multiverseId\': 165350}, \'multiverseid\': 165350}, {\'name\': \'Ciel changeant\', \'text\': \'Au moment où le Ciel changeant arrive en jeu, choisissez une couleur.\\nTous les permanents non-terrain sont de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Qui tient le ciel, tient la terre. —Dicton métathran\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21005c2b-5909-4a37-91ff-d8ac791642d2\', \'multiverseId\': 163070}, \'multiverseid\': 163070}, {\'name\': \'Cielo Cangiante\', \'text\': \'Mentre il Cielo Cangiante entra in gioco, scegli un colore.\\nTutti i permanenti non terra sono del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Controlla il cielo e comanderai tutto ciò che si trova sotto di esso. —detto metatrano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e487ee0-932d-48f3-b1e1-dc6fec1679e9\', \'multiverseId\': 164993}, \'multiverseid\': 164993}, {\'name\': \'変容する大空\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec47933-10d3-4595-9a9e-edfc3086d55e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Atmosfera Mutável\', \'text\': \'Conforme Atmosfera Mutável entra em jogo, escolha uma cor.\\nTodas as permanentes que não sejam terrenos são da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Domina o céu e serás regente de tudo por baixo dele." — Ditado Metathran\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973c6d8e-fb46-4bd0-8750-7780bf1357e5\', \'multiverseId\': 165707}, \'multiverseid\': 165707}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auktion der Diebe\', \'text\': \'Lege alle Karten im Spiel beiseite. Bei dir beginnend bestimmt jeder Spieler eine der beiseite gelegten Karten und bringt sie getappt unter seiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Wiederhole diesen Prozess, bis alle diese Karten bestimmt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e209fb58-f882-4229-9310-64179ef23d48\', \'multiverseId\': 162840}, \'multiverseid\': 162840}, {\'name\': \'Subasta de ladrones\', \'text\': \'Pon a un lado todas las cartas que estén en juego. Empezando contigo, cada jugador elige una de esas cartas y la pone en juego girada bajo su control. Hay que repetir este proceso hasta que todas las cartas hayan sido elegidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d85d0d28-673e-4091-a59f-c50ab4804abe\', \'multiverseId\': 165477}, \'multiverseid\': 165477}, {\'name\': \'Enchères de voleurs\', \'text\': "Mettez de côté toutes les cartes en jeu. En commençant par vous, chaque joueur choisit une des cartes mises de côté et la met en jeu engagée, sous son contrôle. Continuez ainsi jusqu\'à ce que toutes les cartes aient été choisies.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163197&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f748b15-3291-4e5c-82d3-d97097ad03d3\', \'multiverseId\': 163197}, \'multiverseid\': 163197}, {\'name\': \'Asta dei Ladri\', \'text\': \'Metti da parte tutte le carte in gioco. A cominciare da te, ogni giocatore sceglie una delle carte messe da parte e la mette in gioco sotto il proprio controllo TAPpata. Ripeti questo procedimento fino a quando tutte le carte sono state scelte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45dc49ce-6119-4906-bc3d-acf4b86c99e5\', \'multiverseId\': 165120}, \'multiverseid\': 165120}, {\'name\': \'泥棒の競り\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff201179-282c-4046-b868-5c6008a7b097\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Leilão dos Ladrões\', \'text\': \'Coloque de lado todos os cards que estiverem em jogo. Começando por você, cada jogador escolhe um dos cards postos de lado e o coloca em jogo virado sob seu próprio controle. Repita este processo até que todos os cards tenham sido escolhidos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f8206f-13ea-4e14-9be7-3457d312d8e8\', \'multiverseId\': 165834}, \'multiverseid\': 165834}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avatar der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Falls du 3 Lebenspunkte oder weniger hast, kostet der Avatar der Hoffnung beim Ausspielen {6} weniger.\\nFliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nDer Avatar der Hoffnung kann eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f03e96-3615-41e7-ac44-b72259858e95\', \'multiverseId\': 162613}, \'multiverseid\': 162613}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de la esperanza\', \'text\': \'Si tienes 3 vidas o menos, cuesta {6} menos jugar el Avatar de la esperanza..\\nVuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nEl Avatar de la esperanza puede bloquear cualquier número de criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea59bb0c-9f83-4ef2-9f10-3f35ce23a559\', \'multiverseId\': 165251}, \'multiverseid\': 165251}, {\'name\': "Avatar de l\'espoir", \'text\': "Si vous avez au maximum 3 points de vie, l\'Avatar de l\'espoir vous coûte {6} de moins à jouer.\\nVol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nL\'Avatar de l\'espoir peut bloquer un nombre quelconque de créatures.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162971&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b989ea63-a491-4152-a894-66c8023c5b11\', \'multiverseId\': 162971}, \'multiverseid\': 162971}, {\'name\': \'Avatar della Speranza\', \'text\': "Se hai 3 punti vita o meno, l\'Avatar della Speranza costa {6} in meno per essere giocato.\\nVolare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nL\'Avatar della Speranza può bloccare un qualsiasi numero di creature.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88be441d-d72d-4b38-9293-f48efe12864e\', \'multiverseId\': 164894}, \'multiverseid\': 164894}, {\'name\': \'希望の化身\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98ef348-0f71-493f-8f0a-fc2f6b0090e1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Avatar da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Se você tiver 3 pontos de vida ou menos, Avatar da Esperança custa {6} a menos para jogar.\\nVoar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nAvatar da Esperança pode bloquear qualquer número de criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18640a80-1135-46ef-92fe-b81804b4fff0\', \'multiverseId\': 165608}, \'multiverseid\': 165608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Fischer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Avior-Fischer aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Mit denselben Speeren, mit denen sie heute ihr Essen aufspießen, werden sie morgen ihre Häuser verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b6e078-e711-4ad6-a754-a0506b9a4889\', \'multiverseId\': 162674}, \'multiverseid\': 162674}, {\'name\': \'Pescador aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)Cuando el Pescador aven vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'Las mismas lanzas que usan los aven para atrapar su comida hoy, defenderán sus hogares mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8422fbfa-a704-4825-b8eb-e806313f608f\', \'multiverseId\': 165311}, \'multiverseid\': 165311}, {\'name\': \'Pêcheur avemain\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nQuand le Pêcheur avemain est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Ils défendront demain leur maison avec cette même lance qui leur sert aujourd\'hui à attraper leur nourriture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45e8601-a1f6-40e9-b1a8-d67d7825a1eb\', \'multiverseId\': 163031}, \'multiverseid\': 163031}, {\'name\': \'Pescatore Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nQuando il Pescatore Aviano viene messo in un cimitero dal gioco, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Le stesse lance che catturano oggi il loro cibo difenderanno un domani le loro case.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7352e8e-09b6-4c62-b5bc-81e8e462bb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 164954}, \'multiverseid\': 164954}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの魚捕り\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6af8fdd-4d21-45ca-bbd9-f59981ca07c2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Pescador Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nQuando Pescador Aviano é colocado num cemitério vindo de jogo, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'As mesmas lanças que caçam sua comida hoje irão defender suas casas amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd60f1e7-9a53-4a92-ad86-50932a76a22b\', \'multiverseId\': 165668}, \'multiverseid\': 165668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Wolkenjäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Avior-Wolkenjäger ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'999ffd70-0371-451d-b2ca-7bebbf28a4af\', \'multiverseId\': 162616}, \'multiverseid\': 162616}, {\'name\': \'Cazanubes aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)Cuando el Cazanubes aven entre en juego, destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ba1d1b-d4c8-4e51-abae-3ca41eca8d98\', \'multiverseId\': 165252}, \'multiverseid\': 165252}, {\'name\': \'Avemain chasse-nuage\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nQuand l\'Avemain chasse-nuage arrive en jeu, détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162972&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6641ed51-37ed-4487-9455-ba72328a923a\', \'multiverseId\': 162972}, \'multiverseid\': 162972}, {\'name\': \'Caccianubi Aviano\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nQuando il Caccianubi Aviano entra in gioco, distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e87d002-fe6d-489f-9ea3-8f91ea974829\', \'multiverseId\': 164895}, \'multiverseid\': 164895}, {\'name\': \'雲を追うエイヴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78614394-dd76-40e3-8947-314c385c090f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Caça-nuvens Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nQuando Caça-nuvens Aviano entra em jogo, destrói o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fae5374-8e04-4887-9f07-bd06043c96e8\', \'multiverseId\': 165610}, \'multiverseid\': 165610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aviorschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\n{W}: Der Aviorschwarm erhält +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'So wie jede weitere Feder den Flügel kräftiger macht, so wächst die Macht des Schwarms mit jedem weiteren Rekruten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162618&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b2a1ca-2bb6-4746-9294-eabc26959a43\', \'multiverseId\': 162618}, \'multiverseid\': 162618}, {\'name\': \'Parvada aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\n{W}: La Parvada aven obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado ave\', \'flavor\': \'De la misma manera en que cada pluma agregada estabiliza el ala, la parvada se fortalece con cada miembro nuevo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a8760f-f0b7-4d34-956f-7d9ddb0f142e\', \'multiverseId\': 165255}, \'multiverseid\': 165255}, {\'name\': "Nuée d\'avemains", \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\n{W} : La Nuée d\'avemains gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Tout comme chaque plume renforce l\'aile, la nuée devient plus forte avec chaque nouvel arrivant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162975&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d30afa24-6141-479d-b30b-1addac2c1cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 162975}, \'multiverseid\': 162975}, {\'name\': \'Stormo di Aviani\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\n{W}: Lo Stormo di Aviani prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Come ogni nuova piuma rende l\'ala più stabile, così lo stormo diventa più forte per ogni nuovo membro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10bf126e-0baa-4ded-aa2a-a30eb2506663\', \'multiverseId\': 164898}, \'multiverseid\': 164898}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの群れ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0771481-3db9-4a04-934c-4e9713160371\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bando Aviano\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\n{W}: Bando Aviano recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado Pássaro\', \'flavor\': \'Assim como cada pena adicionada estabiliza a asa, o bando se fortalece com cada novo membro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4806e15-0690-413b-baa9-f78bb9bac79c\', \'multiverseId\': 165612}, \'multiverseid\': 165612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baldachinspinne\', \'text\': \'Die Baldachinspinne kann blocken, als ob sie Flugfähigkeit hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Sie hält die oberen Bereiche des Waldes frei von jeder Bedrohung... außer von sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89b3bd28-4f28-4a23-a3b7-a450c9db3a10\', \'multiverseId\': 162849}, \'multiverseid\': 162849}, {\'name\': \'Araña de la enramada\', \'text\': \'La Araña de la enramada puede bloquear como si tuviera la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Mantiene los confines más elevados del bosque libres de cualquier amenaza . . . excepto de la araña misma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88499c5b-f253-4a1e-925e-65329f619d17\', \'multiverseId\': 165486}, \'multiverseid\': 165486}, {\'name\': \'Araignée de la canopée\', \'text\': "L\'Araignée de la canopée peut bloquer comme si elle avait le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Plus rien ne reste de dangereux au sommet de la forêt… si ce n\'est l\'araignée elle-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a921fe20-5c99-4ecd-a528-8e8c938723d9\', \'multiverseId\': 163206}, \'multiverseid\': 163206}, {\'name\': \'Ragno delle Fronde\', \'text\': \'Il Ragno delle Fronde può bloccare come se avesse volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Conserva le fronde degli alberi al sicuro da ogni pericolo . . . se si eccettua la sua presenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb84cc5-0e00-4344-9f91-4de76d888525\', \'multiverseId\': 165129}, \'multiverseid\': 165129}, {\'name\': \'梢の蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae527aea-c23b-4572-8db5-472e9c35918d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Aranha Baldaquina\', \'text\': \'Aranha Baldaquina pode bloquear como se tivesse a habilidade de voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Ela mantém os limites superiores da floresta livres de todas as ameaças com exceção dela própria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd2fc6b7-be59-4791-b9c6-3244388c4e42\', \'multiverseId\': 165843}, \'multiverseid\': 165843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balduvianische Barbaren\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Barbar\', \'flavor\': \'„Von den verschneiten Gipfeln von Kaelor, Zu den Flusstälern von Bandu, Wir trinken und kämpfen, fressen und sterben, Wozu wir geboren wurden." —Balduvianischer Kneipensong\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9999cef-4b21-44e6-97a7-417906a14e12\', \'multiverseId\': 162789}, \'multiverseid\': 162789}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros balduvianos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro\', \'flavor\': \'"De las laderas nevadas de Kaelor,a los cañones de Bandu, bebemos y peleamos y nos deleitamos y morimos, y lo hacemos porque para eso nacimos." Canción balduviana de taberna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecec3efe-d0ff-461c-abb5-d130d2763a69\', \'multiverseId\': 165426}, \'multiverseid\': 165426}, {\'name\': \'Barbares balduvians\', \'type\': \'Créature : barbare\', \'flavor\': \'« Des pentes neigeuses de Kaelor aux canyons de Bandou, nous buvons et baisons et mourons car nous ne sommes pas des bande mou. » —Chanson à boire balduviane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb6a935-5d38-4e60-97a6-6f0bbb2e69d8\', \'multiverseId\': 163146}, \'multiverseid\': 163146}, {\'name\': \'Barbari di Balduvia\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Barbaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Dalle pendici innevate di Kaelor, Ai canyon di Bandu, Beviamo, combattiamo, banchettiamo e moriamo Così come ci è dato di fare dalla nascita." —Canzone da taverna di Balduvia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4dec15-fdce-4747-a2b0-a0945c32adb5\', \'multiverseId\': 165069}, \'multiverseid\': 165069}, {\'name\': \'バルデュヴィアの蛮族\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fcbfc1-514c-4214-96f3-d56accebb1f5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bárbaros Balduvianos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro\', \'flavor\': \'"Das encostas nevadas de Kaelor, Até os desfiladeiros de Bandu, Bebemos e lutamos e comemos e morremos É isso que fazemos desde que nascemos." — Canção balduviana de taverna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b724a7f0-e063-434a-9d57-f5785ba0aadd\', \'multiverseId\': 165783}, \'multiverseid\': 165783}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bedrückendes Miraculum\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl nennt eine Karte und zeigt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek offen vor. Ist es die genannte Karte, nimmt dieser Spieler diese Karte auf seine Hand. Sonst legt der Spieler sie auf seinen Friedhof, und das Bedrückende Mirakulum fügt ihm 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e9d2ac-5dcb-4ee9-bdf6-cc40214d5c65\', \'multiverseId\': 162932}, \'multiverseid\': 162932}, {\'name\': \'Vexim arcana\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: El jugador objetivo nombra una carta, luego muestra la carta de la parte superior de su biblioteca. Si es la carta nombrada, el jugador la pone en su mano. Si no, el jugador la pone en su cementerio y la Vexim arcana le hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919ba773-8522-4bfc-87a4-1dda61a9f3b2\', \'multiverseId\': 165569}, \'multiverseid\': 165569}, {\'name\': \'Arcanologue vexatoire\', \'text\': "{3}, {T} : Le joueur ciblé nomme une carte, et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est la carte nommée, le joueur la met dans sa main. Sinon, le joueur la met dans son cimetière et l\'Arcanologue vexatoire lui inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fa02bd3-f329-48f8-bd4b-d94ff5fa23e2\', \'multiverseId\': 163289}, \'multiverseid\': 163289}, {\'name\': \'Reliquia Vessatrice\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: : Il giocatore bersaglio nomina una carta, quindi rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Se è la carta nominata, il giocatore la aggiunge alla propria mano. Altrimenti, il giocatore la mette nel proprio cimitero e la Reliquia Vessatrice gli infligge 2 danni.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e72c089-aa76-4f07-9e12-0c3d11971bfe\', \'multiverseId\': 165212}, \'multiverseid\': 165212}, {\'name\': \'難問の秘儀具\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0addfb28-5671-4f35-b5b5-43135543e2dc\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Arcanix Perturbador\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: O jogador alvo nomeia um card e depois revela o card do topo de seu próprio grimório. Se for o card nomeado, o jogador o coloca em sua própria mão. Se não, o jogador o coloca em seu próprio cemitério e Arcanix Perturbador causa 2 pontos de dano a ele próprio.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975b44ba-0292-4d63-9617-fea6bc9c10fd\', \'multiverseId\': 165926}, \'multiverseid\': 165926}]', "[{'name': 'Berglöwe', 'text': 'Gebirgstarnung (Diese Kreatur ist unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler ein Gebirge kontrolliert.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze', 'flavor': 'Im Kriegerreich von Keld sind Katzen, die bei Jagden eingesetzt werden können, hoch geschätzt, da sie bei der Spurensuche und beim Überwinden von Hindernissen sehr hilfreich sind.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162794&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '419cd767-8b2d-4060-bc7b-341200255af7', 'multiverseId': 162794}, 'multiverseid': 162794}, {'name': 'Lince de los desfiladeros', 'text': 'Cruza montañas. (Esta criatura es imbloqueable mientras el jugador defensor controle una montaña.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Felino', 'flavor': 'En el reino guerrero de Keld, los felinos usados en la caza son valorados por su sentido de rastreo y su habilidad para escalar muros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165431&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87dbcb2e-2830-4a2b-8b6a-fd9117b85188', 'multiverseId': 165431}, 'multiverseid': 165431}, {'name': 'Chat sauvage des canyons', 'text': 'Traversée des montagnes (Cette créature est imblocable tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une montagne.)', 'type': 'Créature : chat', 'flavor': 'Au royaume guerrier de Keld, les chats de chasse sont prisés pour leur odorat et leur capacité à escalader les murs.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163151&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fac758db-2ae7-41bc-924b-ddfd951637e7', 'multiverseId': 163151}, 'multiverseid': 163151}, {'name': 'Lince dei Canyon', 'text': 'Passa-montagne (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla almeno una Montagna.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Felino', 'flavor': 'Nel regno guerriero di Keld, i felini utilizzati per la caccia sono molto apprezzati per la loro abilità nel seguire tracce e per la capacità di arrampicarsi sui muri.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165074&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7f28af5-8a74-461d-9999-8028dfc1da51', 'multiverseId': 165074}, 'multiverseid': 165074}, {'name': '峡谷の山猫', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89ecbcf6-0da5-4554-b3ad-0adc94bc5d8c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lince do Desfiladeiro', 'text': 'Travessia de Montanha (Esta criatura não pode ser bloqueada desde que o jogador defensor controle uma Montanha.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Gato', 'flavor': 'No reino guerreiro de Keld, os felinos usados na caçada são valorizados por seu senso de rastreamento e sua capacidade de subir em muros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165788&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26b66e70-04d1-4cbc-84e7-87f081ba166a', 'multiverseId': 165788}, 'multiverseid': 165788}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bestechung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche die Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl nach einer Kreaturenkarte und bringe diese Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In Merkadia hängt die Loyalität deiner Anhänger direkt vom Umfang deiner Börse ab.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162677&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ba2c09-7a29-4734-bbc6-fa57ada25a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 162677}, \'multiverseid\': 162677}, {\'name\': \'Soborno\', \'text\': \'Busca una carta de criatura en la biblioteca del oponente objetivo y pon esa carta en juego bajo tu control. Luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En la Ciudad de Mercadia, las lealtades se extienden sólo hasta donde alcance tu bolsillo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5c94d4-8154-4396-a5ed-e45fef120bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 165314}, \'multiverseid\': 165314}, {\'name\': \'Subornation\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans la bibliothèque de l\'adversaire ciblé une carte de créature et mettez cette carte en jeu sous votre contrôle. Ce joueur mélange ensuite sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'À Mercadia, toute loyauté peut être achetée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d531be7-6264-4acc-aefa-16e4fad7c9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 163034}, \'multiverseid\': 163034}, {\'name\': \'Corruzione\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il grimorio di un avversario bersaglio, scegli una carta creatura e metti in gioco quella carta sotto il tuo controllo. Poi quel giocatore rimescola il proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Nella Città di Mercadia, la fedeltà è grande quanto l\'apertura del tuo portamonete.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f090105-2c45-4b9e-8044-a168227f5699\', \'multiverseId\': 164957}, \'multiverseid\': 164957}, {\'name\': \'袖の下\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc02ea9a-b9db-416f-a990-0badbcec24a3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Suborno\', \'text\': \'Procure no grimório do oponente alvo por um card de criatura e coloque aquele card em jogo sob seu controle. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha seu próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Na cidade de Mercádia, as lealdades são tão grandes quanto o tamanho da tua bolsa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e68b244-6447-4000-8b28-94c045882e89\', \'multiverseId\': 165671}, \'multiverseid\': 165671}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beträchtliche Blüte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Wald für Mana getappt wird, erhöht dessen Beherrscher seinen Manavorrat zusätzlich um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Himmel bricht auf, die Bestien scharren mit den Hufen, und der Wald erwacht, um seine Feinde zu bekämpfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85acf442-50fd-405c-bd35-e9bbcbc88e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 162899}, \'multiverseid\': 162899}, {\'name\': \'Florecimiento primaveral\', \'text\': \'Siempre que se gire un Bosque para obtener maná, su controlador agrega {G} a su reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El sol sale, las bestias se agitan y el bosque despierta para enfrentar a sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c180dc5-0819-48cd-933a-73a61d6bfc6f\', \'multiverseId\': 165536}, \'multiverseid\': 165536}, {\'name\': \'Floraison printanière\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une forêt est engagée pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute {G} dans sa réserve.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Qui n\'a cru respirer dans la fleur renaissante, Les parfums regrettés de ses premiers printemps. » — Marceline Desbordes-Valmore", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163256&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64607325-5a1d-4e17-9f80-9465588c3af2\', \'multiverseId\': 163256}, \'multiverseid\': 163256}, {\'name\': \'Fioritura Primaverile\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una Foresta viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge {G} alla propria riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Il sole si spacca, le bestie si agitano e la foresta si sveglia per affrontare i propri nemici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf94c0f-fb37-4163-8ca4-113a8b551451\', \'multiverseId\': 165179}, \'multiverseid\': 165179}, {\'name\': \'花盛りの春\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c701d5b-db68-4cf5-980d-8e5772ed99bd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Florescência Vernal\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma Floresta for virada para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona {G} à sua própria reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O sol irrompe, as bestas se agitam e a floresta desperta para se postar contra seus inimigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d62f97-323c-471f-964f-cfcbd6905c22\', \'multiverseId\': 165893}, \'multiverseid\': 165893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewusstseinserweiterung\', \'text\': \'Verändere den Text einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, indem du im Text alle Vorkommen eines Farbwortes durch ein anderes oder alle Vorkommen eines Standardlandtyps durch ein anderes ersetzt. (Zum Beispiel kannst du „nichtschwarze Kreatur" in „nichtgrüne Kreatur" umändern oder „Waldtarnung" in „Ebenentarnung". Dieser Effekt endet nicht am Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d371e6-c5cb-4e83-9afd-7df08728af2f\', \'multiverseId\': 162705}, \'multiverseid\': 162705}, {\'name\': \'Torsión mental\', \'text\': \'Cambia el texto del permanente objetivo reemplazando todas las menciones de un color por otro o un tipo de tierra básica por otro. (Por ejemplo, puedes cambiar "criatura que no sea negra" por "criatura que no sea verde" o "cruza bosques" por "cruza llanuras". Este efecto no termina al final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a76fab1-ae63-4582-a62e-2f5353fe9d36\', \'multiverseId\': 165342}, \'multiverseid\': 165342}, {\'name\': \'Ploiement mental\', \'text\': "Changez le texte de règles d\'un permanent ciblé en remplaçant toutes les occurrences d\'un nom de couleur par un autre nom de couleur ou d\'un type de terrain de base par un autre. (Par exemple, vous pouvez remplacer « créature non-noire » par « créature non-verte » ou « traversée des forêts » par « traversée des plaines. » Cet effet ne s\'arrête pas à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c961adc7-0cb6-494a-b123-c400f7c30d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 163062}, \'multiverseid\': 163062}, {\'name\': \'Piegare la Mente\', \'text\': \'Cambia il testo di un permanente bersaglio sostituendo tutte le occorrenze di un nome di colore con un altro o il tipo di una terra base con un altro. (Per esempio, puoi cambiare "creatura non nera" in "creatura non verde" o "passa-foreste" in "passa-pianure". Questo effetto non termina alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c67b6cb-73b0-46f2-a234-747ae354fa04\', \'multiverseId\': 164985}, \'multiverseid\': 164985}, {\'name\': \'幻覚\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb039b6-bc5b-4b1a-bcf4-f2401888eb5b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Contraverter a Mente\', \'text\': \'Mude o texto da permanente alvo substituindo todas as palavras relativas a uma cor por outra, ou um tipo de terreno básico por outro. (Por exemplo, você pode mudar "criatura que não seja preta" para "criatura que não seja verde" ou "travessia de floresta" para "travessia de planície". Este efeito não cessa no final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2bc0e6a-cc60-4283-b625-97e80a898b66\', \'multiverseId\': 165699}, \'multiverseid\': 165699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bleichholzrüstung\', \'text\': \'Die verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es hat nie einen Zwergenschmied gegeben, der die Wunder schaffen könnte, die Gaea selber schmiedet." —Champion der Elfen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'220ec816-c35d-45d6-a10e-af7465c5eb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 162847}, \'multiverseid\': 162847}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de maderapálida\', \'text\': \'La criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada bosque que controles.\', \'type\': \'Encantar criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca ha habido un herrero enano que haya podido igualar las maravillas que forja Gaia." —Campeona élfica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f93300a-3520-433b-90f0-37aeb876e736\', \'multiverseId\': 165484}, \'multiverseid\': 165484}, {\'name\': \'Armure de boisblanc\', \'text\': \'La créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchanter : créature\', \'flavor\': \'« Aucun forgeron nain ne pourra égaler les merveilles que Gaia forge elle-même.» — Championne elfe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e0e7db-b238-489c-9e28-de3abfde1aee\', \'multiverseId\': 163204}, \'multiverseid\': 163204}, {\'name\': \'Armatura di Boscopallido\', \'text\': \'La creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Foresta che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incanta Creatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è mai esistito un fabbro dei nani capace di eguagliare le meraviglie forgiate dalla stessa Gaea". —campione elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef652245-5489-4ab3-b74a-27fa6bb1f4aa\', \'multiverseId\': 165127}, \'multiverseid\': 165127}, {\'name\': \'ブランチウッドの鎧\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c064c538-2026-482b-8e4e-19c67e7fe2b9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Blanchwood\', \'text\': \'A criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Floresta que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantar Criatura\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais existiu um anão ferreiro que fosse capaz de igualar as maravilhas que a própria Géia forja." — Campeão élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4167d1-b1eb-40a9-b5d6-484735cfa271\', \'multiverseId\': 165841}, \'multiverseid\': 165841}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blendender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn der Blendende Engel einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, übergeht dieser Spieler seine nächste Kampfphase.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Augen werden ausdörren und erblinden im Antlitz des wahren Lichts des Schicksals."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2024633f-b308-4d15-a163-4d18858462ca\', \'multiverseId\': 162621}, \'multiverseid\': 162621}, {\'name\': \'Ángel cegador\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)Siempre que el Ángel cegador haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador se salta su siguiente fase de combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Sus ojos se consumirán y ennegrecerán ante la luz verdadera de la fe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a47cf5e-9cce-4977-9f41-a4e5d2f0e878\', \'multiverseId\': 165258}, \'multiverseid\': 165258}, {\'name\': \'Ange aveuglante\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ange aveuglante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur passe sa prochaine phase de combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Leurs yeux se flétriront sous l\'effet de la vraie lumière de la foi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162978&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6ea3e9-7036-42aa-b176-25115ab260db\', \'multiverseId\': 162978}, \'multiverseid\': 162978}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Accecante\', \'text\': "Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Angelo Accecante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore salta la sua prossima fase di combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"I loro occhi avvizziranno e si oscureranno davanti alla vera luce della fede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce71fbb-517b-4154-b0a1-8f140348e786\', \'multiverseId\': 164901}, \'multiverseid\': 164901}, {\'name\': \'まばゆい天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecd1fb9-4df4-407e-b207-6ed858037cf7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Ofuscante\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nToda vez que Anjo Ofuscante causar dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador pula sua próxima fase de combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"Seus olhos serão atrofiados e cegados pela verdadeira luz da fé."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020cff7f-8742-4a3d-8e1f-b707618c701c\', \'multiverseId\': 165615}, \'multiverseid\': 165615}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzelementar\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann in dem Zug, in dem sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt, angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Blitz im Gewitter kommt leuchtend herab, Er scheidet vom Leben und ruht jetzt im Grab." —William Knox, „Sterblichkeit"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162814&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a3cb488-6e35-42f8-890d-d5216e80a10a\', \'multiverseId\': 162814}, \'multiverseid\': 162814}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de rayos\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar el turno en que entre bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Un destello del relámpago, un rompimiento de la ola,él pasa de la vida a descansar en la tumba." William Knox, "Mortalidad"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a36bef5-b964-42d4-acad-9b6ee19aa7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 165451}, \'multiverseid\': 165451}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'éclair", \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« Je vais, d\'un coup de poing, te briser comme verre (…)Ou te jeter si haut au-dessus des éclairs, Que tu sois dévoré des feux élémentaires. » — Corneille, L\'Illusion comique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c38f5f-ce1d-4152-84ef-13b068f4e231\', \'multiverseId\': 163171}, \'multiverseid\': 163171}, {\'name\': \'Elementale dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare nel turno in cui entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Il bagliore di un lampo, l\\\'infrangersi delle onde, Ed egli passa dalla vita al proprio riposo nella bara." —William Knox, "Mortalità"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323ba8b7-ae7b-4e10-9b4e-e9f819288a26\', \'multiverseId\': 165094}, \'multiverseid\': 165094}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286ee128-597c-4849-8446-f76f00260dd9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar no turno em que entra em jogo sob seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Um lampejo do raio, uma fenda da onda, Da vida ele passa, ao repouso na cova funda." — William Knox, "Mortalidade"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a763e98-66b0-46cb-bb13-45162ad84c11\', \'multiverseId\': 165808}, \'multiverseid\': 165808}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzentgegnung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„So viel zu dieser klugen Idee."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162691&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de62cd09-985e-473a-9b6f-d45cefe4b7e1\', \'multiverseId\': 162691}, \'multiverseid\': 162691}, {\'name\': \'Contraataque repentino\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo de instantáneo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Esa idea brillante no sirvió de nada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148f91ea-81ca-42f3-a72d-4c8c1ef9d5a3\', \'multiverseId\': 165328}, \'multiverseid\': 165328}, {\'name\': \'Contresort immédiat\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez le sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Moi qui pensait avoir eu une bonne idée... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee47abe-2bb3-4fa9-9c2e-6f5313266539\', \'multiverseId\': 163048}, \'multiverseid\': 163048}, {\'name\': \'Neutralizzazione Fulminea\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutta quella fatica per niente"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283fa1c0-20b1-4b5c-977e-c390adf78de4\', \'multiverseId\': 164971}, \'multiverseid\': 164971}, {\'name\': \'緊急阻止\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b7f29b-115d-4ebe-9c9b-89bc284a3199\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Anulação Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Anula a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"E assim se perde uma idéia brilhante"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba2910f-e14e-40a5-abda-09051146eb2c\', \'multiverseId\': 165685}, \'multiverseid\': 165685}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzstrahl\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzstrahl fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer sich vor der Dunkelheit fürchtet, hat noch nie erleben müssen, was Licht alles anrichten kann." —Selenia, der Dunkle Engel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81f0268-36e0-4ca3-99ff-3293ee568478\', \'multiverseId\': 162813}, \'multiverseid\': 162813}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga de rayos\', \'text\': \'La Ráfaga de rayos hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquéllos que le temen a la oscuridad nunca han visto lo que puede hacer la luz". —Selenia, ángel perverso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e39bea46-99b2-449c-88b2-dfb087983c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 165450}, \'multiverseid\': 165450}, {\'name\': "Salve d\'éclair", \'text\': "La Salve d\'éclair inflige 4 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ceux qui craignent les ténèbres n\'ont jamais vu ce que peut faire la lumière. » —Sélénia, l\'ange noir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78541e4c-d2b1-4aed-8167-529186a4c692\', \'multiverseId\': 163170}, \'multiverseid\': 163170}, {\'name\': \'Fulmine Esplosivo\', \'text\': \'Il Fulmine Esplosivo infligge 4 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Coloro che temono l\\\'oscurità non hanno ancora visto cosa può fare la luce". —Selenia, l\\\'angelo oscuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8617fadc-5317-4f33-bdfa-2735fd6662ce\', \'multiverseId\': 165093}, \'multiverseid\': 165093}, {\'name\': \'電撃破\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279b0d24-0e78-43b1-814e-adecbf8a8d59\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Explosão do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Explosão do Relâmpago causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Aqueles que temem a escuridão nunca viram do que a luz é capaz." — Selenia, anjo das trevas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a40ad227-121e-4c47-b2f1-fd09c7135974\', \'multiverseId\': 165807}, \'multiverseid\': 165807}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutaugenzyklop\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Der Blutaugenzyklop fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Nach ihrem ersten Aufeinandertreffen nannten ihn die Goblins Charlie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'666edc2b-dce0-4f64-b52b-40d54ff207ed\', \'multiverseId\': 162792}, \'multiverseid\': 162792}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope cruento\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar una criatura: El Cíclope cruento hace una cantidad de daño igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Después de su primer encuentro, los trasgos lo llamaron "Lanzador".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c064be2-9f18-4170-b544-16c7f4d5e3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 165429}, \'multiverseid\': 165429}, {\'name\': \'Cyclope sanguin\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Le Cyclope sanguin inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, autant de blessures que la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Après leur première rencontre, les gobelins le nommèrent Chuck.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17998b11-fd6e-423e-b4a8-5b49c3366989\', \'multiverseId\': 163149}, \'multiverseid\': 163149}, {\'name\': \'Ciclopi Sanguinari\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: I Ciclopi Sanguinari infliggono un ammontare di danni pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo il loro primo incontro, i goblin lo avevano battezzato Chuck.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87e3ca12-6e18-4706-8773-6009d10e0b39\', \'multiverseId\': 165072}, \'multiverseid\': 165072}, {\'name\': \'血まなこのサイクロプス\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c64a088-f6d5-4877-aa74-2493763ba240\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope de Olho Injetado\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Cíclope de Olho Injetado causa à criatura alvo ou ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de pontos de dano igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Depois de seu primeiro encontro, os goblins passaram a chamá-lo de Vermelhão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41205b16-4ad4-4ab4-90fc-362f6f6600f7\', \'multiverseId\': 165786}, \'multiverseid\': 165786}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutmond\', \'text\': \'Alle Nichtstandardländer sind Gebirge.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Schweres Licht überflutete die Landschaft und hüllte alles in tiefe Rottöne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a49640a-b278-4bb8-a546-8ea234186248\', \'multiverseId\': 162791}, \'multiverseid\': 162791}, {\'name\': \'Luna de sangre\', \'text\': \'Las tierras no básicas son montañas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Una luz muy brillante inundó el paisaje, envolviendo todo en un carmesí intenso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ae3abf-51b5-4a06-937d-e55479ad092c\', \'multiverseId\': 165428}, \'multiverseid\': 165428}, {\'name\': \'Lune de sang\', \'text\': \'Tous les terrains non-base sont des montagnes.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "La lune étrange perçait les ténèbres, empourprant le paysage comme s\'il baignait dans le sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435aa159-08f5-45c3-982d-e9d3155d6287\', \'multiverseId\': 163148}, \'multiverseid\': 163148}, {\'name\': \'Luna Insanguinata\', \'text\': \'Le terre non base sono Montagne.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Una luce greve scese su tutto il paesaggio, ammantando ogni cosa di un rosso profondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a70956-da78-48cd-9097-7949fca5780b\', \'multiverseId\': 165071}, \'multiverseid\': 165071}, {\'name\': \'血染めの月\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ded89f9b-9d11-4f9c-89dc-2bb9edc46ac7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Lua Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'Os terrenos não-básicos são Montanhas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Uma luz intensa inundou a paisagem, cobrindo tudo de um escarlate profundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543b2930-1e2b-460c-927e-2dbef8810dd5\', \'multiverseId\': 165785}, \'multiverseid\': 165785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutsaugender Geist\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nWenn der Blutsaugende Geist ins Spiel kommt, verlierst du 4 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162783&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060a2938-3440-42bb-9046-52d0992272ff\', \'multiverseId\': 162783}, \'multiverseid\': 162783}, {\'name\': \'Espíritu vampírico\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)Cuando el Espíritu vampírico entre en juego, pierde 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce65d00b-1dc4-470a-96e0-48d9977de89c\', \'multiverseId\': 165420}, \'multiverseid\': 165420}, {\'name\': \'Esprit vampirique\', \'text\': "Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nQuand l\'Esprit vampirique arrive en jeu, vous perdez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb3bc76-a4dd-4d87-b6fb-a59f2c87fcb3\', \'multiverseId\': 163140}, \'multiverseid\': 163140}, {\'name\': \'Spirito Vampiro\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nQuando lo Spirito Vampiro entra in gioco, perdi 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05dfd37b-2b25-4d9a-bd2e-bfa658c44611\', \'multiverseId\': 165063}, \'multiverseid\': 165063}, {\'name\': \'吸血のスピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c74bb2aa-a007-45f2-ab8c-1e3034a3083a\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Espírito Vampírico\', \'text\': \'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nQuando Espírito Vampírico entra em jogo, você perde 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b99a7d4e-958b-44b7-8485-eb31a280b360\', \'multiverseId\': 165777}, \'multiverseid\': 165777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blütenzauberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungsspruch spielst, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Betäubt, für einen Augenblick. Verführt, für eine Lebenszeit. Verzaubert, für die Ewigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53455664-b233-4eed-b9aa-224b0d9b2db7\', \'multiverseId\': 162898}, \'multiverseid\': 162898}, {\'name\': \'Encantadora de plantas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo de encantamiento, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Grácil? Sí. ¿Hermosa? Por supuesto. ¿Inofensiva? Definitivamente, no."—Anciano de Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ec6461-442a-467a-bfc4-5c8dbaa1f009\', \'multiverseId\': 165535}, \'multiverseid\': 165535}, {\'name\': \'Enchanteresse verduralde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort d\'enchantement, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Gracieuse ? Oui. Belle ? Tout à fait. Inoffensive ? Ne le croyez surtout pas. » —Un Ancêtre cordellien\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163255&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'842cfed0-57fa-49ec-9084-08919ff80d3e\', \'multiverseId\': 163255}, \'multiverseid\': 163255}, {\'name\': \'Incantatrice Verde dei Boschi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia incantesimo, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido\', \'flavor\': \'"Graziosa? Sì. Bella? Assolutamente. Innocua? Decisamente no." —Antico di Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c226c570-3e2c-4299-873c-3a04ac2951cd\', \'multiverseId\': 165178}, \'multiverseid\': 165178}, {\'name\': \'新緑の女魔術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06f116d-6777-4c40-8aaa-acaf5aff4100\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bruxa de Verduran\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você jogar uma mágica de encantamento, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Graciosa? Sim. Bela? Certamente. Inofensiva? Não mesmo." — Ancião de Fyndhorn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b739c21c-bddd-43e1-8ade-03cbba0db019\', \'multiverseId\': 165892}, \'multiverseid\': 165892}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bumerang\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Kehre zurück, woher du kamest..." —Edmund Spenser, Die Feenkönigin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24bb245-d935-458e-8451-7e101abaafcd\', \'multiverseId\': 162676}, \'multiverseid\': 162676}, {\'name\': \'Búmerang\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Regresa por donde viniste . . .". —Edmund Spenser, La reina hada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'def4fb42-4e69-4e95-8355-d83550efb9b2\', \'multiverseId\': 165313}, \'multiverseid\': 165313}, {\'name\': \'Boomerang\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La ruse la mieux ourdie peut nuire à son inventeur ; et souvent la perfidie retourne sur son auteur. » —Jean de La Fontaine\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d879b2e0-2f4a-4c3a-ac03-34a96a4c2aed\', \'multiverseId\': 163033}, \'multiverseid\': 163033}, {\'name\': \'Boomerang\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario riprende in mano un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Torna da dove sei venuto. . . ." —Edmund Spenser, La Regina delle Fate\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6346ce-5486-4120-b9d5-07f4f907a0fd\', \'multiverseId\': 164956}, \'multiverseid\': 164956}, {\'name\': \'ブーメラン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa8959e-2695-4d78-b052-6dba066e6fa8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Bumerangue\', \'text\': \'Devolve a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Volta para o lugar donde vieste. . . ." — Edmund Spenser, A Rainha das Fadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc440381-6e33-4339-8dfb-b1517552bcbd\', \'multiverseId\': 165670}, \'multiverseid\': 165670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion der Elfen\', \'text\': \'Alle Elfen erhalten +1/+1 und Waldtarnung. (Sie sind unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Wald kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Herrscher\', \'flavor\': \'„Denn was sind Blätter anderes als Klingen, Um einen zahllosen Feind zu bekämpfen?" —Wolkenwaldhymne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162854&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11b2515a-98cf-4b92-ade3-05c42b59aebf\', \'multiverseId\': 162854}, \'multiverseid\': 162854}, {\'name\': \'Campeona élfica\', \'text\': \'Todos los Elfos obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de cruzar bosques. (Son imbloqueables mientras el jugador defensor controle un bosque.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Señor\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué son las hojas sino incontables espadaspara pelear contra enemigos incontables en las alturas." —Himno élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'322dbdf8-7c11-4328-8b37-e33ba29c1524\', \'multiverseId\': 165491}, \'multiverseid\': 165491}, {\'name\': \'Championne elfe\', \'text\': \'Tous les elfes gagnent +1/+1 et ont la traversée des forêts. (Ils sont imblocables tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une forêt.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : seigneur\', \'flavor\': \'« Car les feuilles ne sont que lames innombrables pour combattre de haut un ennemi implacable. » —Hymne elfe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167419dd-fdaa-41df-b7ee-af550a05f03d\', \'multiverseId\': 163211}, \'multiverseid\': 163211}, {\'name\': \'Campione Elfico\', \'text\': \'Tutti gli Elfi prendono +1/+1 e hanno passa-foreste (Non possono essere bloccati fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla almeno una Foresta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Signore\', \'flavor\': \'"E cosa sono le foglie, se non lame innumerevoli Per combattere nemici innumerevoli in cielo." —Inno elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bd7587-cfbe-4369-b1be-3541417ab084\', \'multiverseId\': 165134}, \'multiverseid\': 165134}, {\'name\': \'エルフのチャンピオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277ffb1d-2330-48d4-8a4e-460da5bb12fb\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Campeão Élfico\', \'text\': \'Todos os Elfos recebem +1/+1 e têm travessia de floresta. (Eles não podem ser bloqueados desde que o jogador defensor controle uma Floresta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Senhor\', \'flavor\': \'"O que são as folhas, senão incontáveis lâminas Para combater incontáveis inimigos no alto." — Hino dos elfos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d70c63a0-0eb2-49bd-8dc2-bde6febf9ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 165848}, \'multiverseid\': 165848}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was meinem Schlag nicht widersteht, das war wohl schlechte Qualität." —Schmiedelied der Zwerge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d68069b-24fa-4790-b9db-f67574cac9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 162796}, \'multiverseid\': 162796}, {\'name\': \'Demoler\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Golpea el acero hasta que quede. ¿No da resultado? Hazlo pedazos." —Canción de forja enana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68bd3f1-63b4-48bf-b3e9-23f4b4856f15\', \'multiverseId\': 165433}, \'multiverseid\': 165433}, {\'name\': \'Démolition\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Frappe l\'acier, c\'est ton boulot A marche pas ? Casse en morceaux » —Chant des forgerons nains", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c58eb9-c5de-4786-b690-fdba05102f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 163153}, \'multiverseid\': 163153}, {\'name\': \'Frantumare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Colpisci l\\\'acciaio fino a quando si piega. Non funziona? Fallo a pezzetti." —Canzone di forgia nanesca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855ab550-edaf-4956-bc55-cd40ca2fcd33\', \'multiverseId\': 165076}, \'multiverseid\': 165076}, {\'name\': \'破砕\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6de064-98d9-4fc5-aab9-8287fa2b8047\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Demolir\', \'text\': \'Destrói o artefato ou o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"P´ro aço amoldar malhamos, malhamos Se não funcionar? Estraçalhamos." — Canção dos anões na forjaria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6bc15b9-4976-4305-8aef-cab8085dbb9d\', \'multiverseId\': 165790}, \'multiverseid\': 165790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Herr der Untoten\', \'text\': \'Alle Zombies erhalten +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Bringe eine Zombiekarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Lord\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verhandle mit dem Tod selber. Was könntest du schon machen, um mir etwas anzuhaben?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162754&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d734a21c-5581-4f36-ab4e-f6bf93e7ecd4\', \'multiverseId\': 162754}, \'multiverseid\': 162754}, {\'name\': \'Señor de los muertos vivientes\', \'text\': \'Todos los Zombies obtienen +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Regresa la carta objetivo de Zombie de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Señor\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo hablo con la misma Muerte. ¿Qué podrías hacer para lastimarme?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efa078f-d538-4ca4-9947-a1c742556f91\', \'multiverseId\': 165391}, \'multiverseid\': 165391}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur des mort-vivants\', \'text\': \'Tous les zombies gagnent +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Renvoyez la carte de zombie ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : seigneur\', \'flavor\': \'« La Mort est ma complice. Que pourrais-tu faire qui puisse me blesser ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c33a75-7e13-45b9-a356-fdd1e8c3f622\', \'multiverseId\': 163111}, \'multiverseid\': 163111}, {\'name\': \'Signore dei Non Morti\', \'text\': \'Tutti gli Zombie prendono +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Riprendi in mano una carta Zombie bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Signore\', \'flavor\': \'"Io conferisco con la Morte stessa. Come speri di riuscire a farmi del male?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4325f879-e6a5-4c71-b9a7-bf6d2418ca79\', \'multiverseId\': 165034}, \'multiverseid\': 165034}, {\'name\': \'アンデッドの王\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d419515-92b6-41c9-807a-36588bf26da3\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Senhor dos Mortos-vivos\', \'text\': \'Todos os Zumbis recebem +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Devolve o card alvo de Zumbi de seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lord\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu falo com a própria Morte. O que poderão vocês fazer para me ferir?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e489ae66-ea42-4fab-a584-8e330ff7bfd7\', \'multiverseId\': 165748}, \'multiverseid\': 165748}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Schmelzofen von Rath\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Quelle einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler Schadenspunkte zufügen würde, fügt sie dieser Kreatur oder diesem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schmelzofen erwartet seinen neuen Meister, der die Feuer der Apokalypse anheizen wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b548a862-78eb-46ab-a141-0b9d662ec036\', \'multiverseId\': 162800}, \'multiverseid\': 162800}, {\'name\': \'Horno de Rath\', \'text\': \'Si una fuente fuera a hacer daño a una criatura o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el doble del daño a esa criatura o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El horno espera al siguiente amo que avivará las llamas del apocalipsis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2573668-6176-42f2-8631-88f103e772bb\', \'multiverseId\': 165437}, \'multiverseid\': 165437}, {\'name\': \'Fourneau de Rajh\', \'text\': \'Si une source devait infliger des blessures à une créature ou un joueur, elle inflige à la place le double de ces blessures à cette créature ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le fourneau attend son maître, qui osera nourrir les feux de l\'apocalypse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a4f5f2-bf05-4640-b17b-5087ddc4da50\', \'multiverseId\': 163157}, \'multiverseid\': 163157}, {\'name\': \'Fornace di Rath\', \'text\': \'Se una fonte sta per infliggere danno a una creatura o a un giocatore, invece infligge il doppio di quel danno a quella creatura o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "La fornace attende il prossimo padrone che attizzerà i fuochi dell\'apocalisse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5c6a469-b3df-4924-ac27-b9bd47d96a02\', \'multiverseId\': 165080}, \'multiverseid\': 165080}, {\'name\': \'ラースの灼熱洞\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f449cb56-a12a-43f0-a2f4-89026bf7925c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fornalha de Rath\', \'text\': \'Se uma fonte fosse causar dano a uma criatura ou a um jogador, em vez disso, ela causa o dobro daquela quantidade de dano àquela criatura ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A fornalha aguarda o próximo mestre, que vai atiçar as fogueiras do apocalipse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba429dbb-8a80-4bb6-b99b-d2be63853241\', \'multiverseId\': 165794}, \'multiverseid\': 165794}]', "[{'name': 'Diebische Elster', 'text': 'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn die Diebische Elster einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, ziehst du eine Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel', 'flavor': 'Andere Vögel sammeln Zweige für ihr Nest. Die Elstern bevorzugen dagegen Juwelen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162720&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97083670-554b-42cf-8f12-d7c2023b69ac', 'multiverseId': 162720}, 'multiverseid': 162720}, {'name': 'Urraca ladrona', 'text': 'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)Siempre que la Urraca ladrona haga daño a un oponente, robas una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': 'Otras aves recolectan ramas para sus nidos. Las urracas roban joyas para los suyos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165357&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e40f92fc-2068-4441-b601-c9f7460b6e85', 'multiverseId': 165357}, 'multiverseid': 165357}, {'name': 'Pie voleuse', 'text': 'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Pie voleuse inflige des blessures à un adversaire, vous piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau', 'flavor': 'Les autres oiseaux cherchent des brindilles pour leurs nids. La pie préfère les joyaux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163077&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '931b407d-afad-4ff3-88c3-9bd351222b01', 'multiverseId': 163077}, 'multiverseid': 163077}, {'name': 'Gazza Ladra', 'text': 'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Gazza Ladra infligge danno a un avversario, tu peschi una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Uccello', 'flavor': 'Gli altri uccelli raccolgono ramoscelli per costruire i loro nidi. Le gazze rubano gioielli per adornare i propri.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165000&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '985c78ea-2102-46d0-b7e6-963d73327aad', 'multiverseId': 165000}, 'multiverseid': 165000}, {'name': '泥棒カササギ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dcd311f-78d7-4d30-8190-2441133973aa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Gralha Larápia', 'text': 'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nToda vez que Gralha Larápia causar dano a um oponente, você compra um card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': 'Os outros pássaros coletam gravetos para seus ninhos. As gralhas roubam jóias para os delas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165714&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e478a6ae-d04d-45ba-a516-7804624d03ad', 'multiverseId': 165714}, 'multiverseid': 165714}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dingus-Ei\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Land aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, fügt das Dingus-Ei dem Beherrscher dieses Landes 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Legende sagt, dass die Welt aus einem Dingus-Ei ausgeschlüpft ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df43489-3926-4ed5-b6e9-97391b62c477\', \'multiverseId\': 162910}, \'multiverseid\': 162910}, {\'name\': \'Huevo de dingus\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una tierra vaya a un cementerio desde el juego, el Huevo de dingus hace 2 puntos de daño al controlador de esa tierra.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La leyenda dice que el mundo salió de un huevo de dingus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7f077f2-3ba7-42a4-a340-c89389a599de\', \'multiverseId\': 165547}, \'multiverseid\': 165547}, {\'name\': \'Œuf de dingus\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un terrain est mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, l\'Œuf de dingus inflige 2 blessures au contrôleur de ce terrain.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les sages disent que le monde vient d\'un œuf de dingus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163267&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9b85f2-9868-42c2-9da5-b8ae2d859d32\', \'multiverseId\': 163267}, \'multiverseid\': 163267}, {\'name\': \'Uovo di Dingus\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una terra viene messa in un cimitero dal gioco, l\'Uovo di Dingus infligge 2 danni al controllore di quella terra.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La leggenda narra che il mondo sia nato da un uovo di dingus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89657be3-db93-45df-a241-bcc9d7867fc6\', \'multiverseId\': 165190}, \'multiverseid\': 165190}, {\'name\': \'不明の卵\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6243c3-d031-4c7c-935d-244c9f8aa90d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ovo Leteano\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um terreno for colocado em algum cemitério vindo de jogo, Ovo Leteano causa 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquele terreno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Diz a lenda que o mundo eclodiu de um ovo leteano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6d1e26-3ef7-475c-9822-3d234f9a267b\', \'multiverseId\': 165904}, \'multiverseid\': 165904}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenelementar\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Dornenelementar seinen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler zufügen lassen, als ob es nicht geblockt worden wäre.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Regen aus diesem Sturm lässt dich sauber aufgespießt zurück — wie einen Käfer in der Vitrine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa7c943-9144-48a0-9390-d68f423b7c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 162896}, \'multiverseid\': 162896}, {\'name\': \'Elemental de espinas\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Elemental de espinas haga su daño de combate al jugador defensor como si no hubiera sido bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'La lluvia de esta tormenta te deja clavado al suelo como a un insecto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a040587-b7fa-4629-a07b-8fdcde9da7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 165533}, \'multiverseid\': 165533}, {\'name\': "Élémental d\'épines", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que les blessures infligées par l\'Élémental d\'épines au joueur défenseur le soient comme s\'il n\'était pas bloqué.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "La pluie d\'épines vous laissera cloué au sol comme un insecte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b9ce91-d92e-4297-91ef-59daf187c8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 163253}, \'multiverseid\': 163253}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Spinato\', \'text\': "Puoi decidere che l\'Elementale Spinato infligga il proprio danno da combattimento al giocatore in difesa come se non fosse stato bloccato.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'La pioggia di questa tempesta ti schiaccia al suolo come un insetto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3411a9f1-4746-42c1-8fb6-80291995315e\', \'multiverseId\': 165176}, \'multiverseid\': 165176}, {\'name\': \'茨の精霊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4551f3-c97a-4fd0-8b57-108e8b9c31e1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Elemental dos Espinhos\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Elemental dos Espinhos cause seu dano de combate ao jogador defensor como se não tivesse sido bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'A chuva desta tempestade te deixa espetado ao solo como se fosses um inseto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc21e058-9984-4a49-978d-4a7b0acab7a6\', \'multiverseId\': 165890}, \'multiverseid\': 165890}]', "[{'name': 'Dornenschwanz-Küken', 'text': 'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\\nOpfere das Dornenschwanz-Küken: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, falls sein Beherrscher nicht {1} bezahlt.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Sceada', 'flavor': 'Er weicht den Wogen der Meere aus, um sich in die Wellen der Magie zu stürzen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162715&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18c0f696-293d-41e7-a35c-98f9a268632e', 'multiverseId': 162715}, 'multiverseid': 162715}, {'name': 'Cría de colapúa', 'text': 'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\\nSacrificar la Cría de colapúa: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {1}.', 'type': 'Criatura — Draco', 'flavor': 'Esquiva olas de agua para prepararse para olas de magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165352&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31f9d8b8-92bf-4863-9728-e922f9625f84', 'multiverseId': 165352}, 'multiverseid': 165352}, {'name': 'Jeune dracodard', 'text': 'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\\nSacrifiez le Jeune dracodard : Contrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {1}.', 'type': 'Créature : drakôn', 'flavor': 'Il esquive les vagues pour se préparer à affronter plus tard les vagues de magie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163072&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0b2e098-169f-470a-a358-81b71bbd6eb1', 'multiverseId': 163072}, 'multiverseid': 163072}, {'name': 'Cucciolo di Codapunta', 'text': 'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\\nSacrifica il Cucciolo di Codapunta: Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore spenda {1}.', 'type': 'Creatura — Draghetto', 'flavor': 'Schiva le onde del mare per allenarsi a schivare le onde di magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=164995&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d789b94-36c8-4c69-9e92-432df090d8f1', 'multiverseId': 164995}, 'multiverseid': 164995}, {'name': 'トゲ尾の雛', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea4cd378-75b3-45aa-924c-489b5bc904f1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cria de Cauda Espigada', 'text': 'Voar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas com a habilidade de voar.)\\nSacrifique Cria de Cauda Espigada: Anula a mágica alvo a menos que seu controlador pague {1}.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dragonete', 'flavor': 'Ele se esquiva das ondas de água, para se preparar contra as ondas de magia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165709&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49e0c9b9-600b-4884-9d97-2c448c8d2227', 'multiverseId': 165709}, 'multiverseid': 165709}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drohender Schatten\', \'text\': \'{B}: Der Drohende Schatten erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schatten\', \'flavor\': \'Er wächst in der Dunkelheit und vermehrt sich in Albträumen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162753&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bebd97d-fd1a-408a-827a-79f70b3d5343\', \'multiverseId\': 162753}, \'multiverseid\': 162753}, {\'name\': \'Sombra vaga\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Sombra vaga obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'Se alimenta de oscuridad, se reproduce en las pesadillas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe8a7c1e-a4ec-4dc1-aecd-9dadeeef26f6\', \'multiverseId\': 165390}, \'multiverseid\': 165390}, {\'name\': \'Ombre surgissante\', \'text\': "{B} : L\'Ombre surgissante gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ombre\', \'flavor\': \'Elle naît des cauchemars et se nourrit des peurs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18abf6fa-7729-4376-89eb-a02ddaca5284\', \'multiverseId\': 163110}, \'multiverseid\': 163110}, {\'name\': \'Bruma in Agguato\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Bruma in Agguato prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bruma\', \'flavor\': "Si nutre d\'oscurità, prolifica negli incubi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8313a28-1862-4757-b0bf-0312bb8cb43b\', \'multiverseId\': 165033}, \'multiverseid\': 165033}, {\'name\': \'立ちはだかる影\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8ef2f1-3db6-43d0-8115-e89df7bda1d4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Vulto Indistinto\', \'text\': \'{B}: Vulto Indistinto recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sombra\', \'flavor\': \'Das trevas se alimenta, dos pesadelos procria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f829dc-9291-4cff-8c41-c769a2553c9b\', \'multiverseId\': 165747}, \'multiverseid\': 165747}]', "[{'name': 'Dunkelwaldghul', 'text': 'Bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Regeneriere den Dunkelwaldghul.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Sie fressen die Lebenden, um untot zu bleiben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162740&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4edfd343-0a76-442e-ba07-837fa0f645a4', 'multiverseId': 162740}, 'multiverseid': 162740}, {'name': 'Necrófago de Deepwood', 'text': 'Pagar 2 vidas: Regenera al Necrófago de Deepwood.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Se alimentan de vivos para mantenerse muertos vivientes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165377&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0ccaa48-961c-49ee-b600-23c49ee1f7b4', 'multiverseId': 165377}, 'multiverseid': 165377}, {'name': 'Goule de Bois profond', 'text': 'Payez 2 points de vie : Régénérez la Goule de Bois profond.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie', 'flavor': 'Elles se nourrissent de vivants pour rester mortes et vivantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163097&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5396f00e-0dd4-4403-bd49-460548e3b3e3', 'multiverseId': 163097}, 'multiverseid': 163097}, {'name': 'Ghoul di Bosco Cupo', 'text': 'Paga 2 punti vita: Rigenera il Ghoul di Bosco Cupo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Zombie', 'flavor': 'Si nutrono dei vivi per rimanere non morti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165020&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f86f6432-e436-4dee-8d97-c60db6304784', 'multiverseId': 165020}, 'multiverseid': 165020}, {'name': 'ディープウッドの食屍鬼', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ed9f4a2-b2d5-47b4-aed0-dca1cc4cd7ee'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Carniçal de Deepwood', 'text': 'Pague 2 pontos de vida: Regenera Carniçal de Deepwood.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi', 'flavor': 'Eles se alimentam dos vivos para continuarem mortos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165734&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f6cafca-7260-4eed-bc43-8da4b5c0a315', 'multiverseId': 165734}, 'multiverseid': 165734}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Verbannung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ha, Verbannung? Sei mitleidiger, sage \\\'Tod\\\', denn Verbannung hat weit mehr Schreckliches in ihren Blicken als der Tod selbst." —William Shakespeare, Romeo und Julia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162736&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3e98a9-93e3-415d-8b39-5d9fb66639e8\', \'multiverseId\': 162736}, \'multiverseid\': 162736}, {\'name\': \'Destierro sombrío\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Ah ¿El destierro? Ten piedad, di la muerte. La proscripción es de faz más terrible, mucho más terrible que la muerte." —William Shakespeare, Romeo y Julieta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e5ad5ee-32d6-44cb-a3de-864e4224f90c\', \'multiverseId\': 165373}, \'multiverseid\': 165373}, {\'name\': \'Obscur bannissement\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature non-noire ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Et leur bannissement, dont j\'accepte la loi, Dépend bien plus de vous, qu\'il ne dépend de moi. » — Molière, Dom Garcie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a91dd95-184b-4a68-8d34-91d109928337\', \'multiverseId\': 163093}, \'multiverseid\': 163093}, {\'name\': \'Esilio Oscuro\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio non nera. Non può essere rigenerata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'esilio? Abbi pietà, di\\\' pure "morte", Poiché l\\\'esilio ha un aspetto molto più terrificante, Della morte stessa."—William Shakespeare, Romeo e Giulietta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e83efac-deed-48ab-9f72-699da0035f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 165016}, \'multiverseid\': 165016}, {\'name\': \'闇への追放\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74176700-ad73-488d-ad4d-a68fa7e4a9fd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Banimento Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Destrói a criatura alvo que não seja preta. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Exílio exílio Sê clemente, dizendo logo \\\'morte\\\', Pois mais horror contém no olhar o exílio que a própria morte." — William Shakespeare, Romeu e Julieta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07660031-869b-475c-8353-0062637f34dd\', \'multiverseId\': 165730}, \'multiverseid\': 165730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerungsbold\', \'text\': \'Fliegend (Diese Kreatur kann nur von fliegenden Kreaturen geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Es verachtet Menschen und Eichhörnchen und Bestien und Zwerge und Zephaliden... tja, eigentlich verachtet es alles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=162743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce53f43a-c352-4c67-8ff5-f9acc7d37a82\', \'multiverseId\': 162743}, \'multiverseid\': 162743}, {\'name\': \'Diablillo del crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Vuela. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo\', \'flavor\': \'Desprecia a los humanos y a las ardillas y a las bestias y a los enanos y a los cefálidos. Bueno, desprecia prácticamente todo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ccb0e93-542a-422a-bd52-9903f30cb771\', \'multiverseId\': 165380}, \'multiverseid\': 165380}, {\'name\': \'Diablotin du crépuscule\', \'text\': \'Vol (Cette créature ne peut être bloquée que par des créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : diablotin\', \'flavor\': \'Il méprise les humains et les écureuils et les bêtes et les nains et les céphalides... Bref il méprise à peu près tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=163100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ebeede-e0d4-48e9-bbfe-107f7b596902\', \'multiverseId\': 163100}, \'multiverseid\': 163100}, {\'name\': \'Demonietto del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': \'Volare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demonietto\', \'flavor\': "Odia gli uomini e gli scoiattoli e le bestie e i nani e i cefalidi. . . be\', odia praticamente tutto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=165023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2002a549-5aef-4a15-9e92-9bfb00f863ee\', \'multiverseId\': 165023}, \'multiverseid\': 165023}, {\'name\': \'薄暮のインプ\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\':