original_text: ["(Walls can't attack.)", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFlying (This creature may block creatures with flying.)", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nFlying (This creature may block creatures with flying.)\\nSunweb can't block creatures with power 2 or less.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\nWhen Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\n{1}{B}: Regenerate Carrion Wall.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.", "All Elves get +1/+1 and have forestwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a Forest.)", "All Goblins get +1/+1 and have mountainwalk. (They're unblockable as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)", 'All Zombies get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Return target Zombie card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'All creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'As Brass Herald comes into play, choose a creature type.\\nWhen Brass Herald comes into play, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all creature cards of the chosen type revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\nCreatures of the chosen type get +1/+1.', 'As Shifting Sky comes into play, choose a color.\\nAll nonland permanents are the chosen color.', 'As Story Circle comes into play, choose a color.\\n{W}: The next time a source of your choice of the chosen color would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws a card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in his or her hand on the bottom of his or her library in any order, then draws that many cards. (That player draws his or her card for the turn first.)", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, Karma deals damage to that player equal to the number of Swamps he or she controls. (Your upkeep step is after you untap and before you draw.)", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and you lose 1 life. (Your upkeep step is after you untap and before you draw.)', "Attacking doesn't cause Ardent Militia to tap.", "Attacking doesn't cause Standing Troops to tap.", 'B', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures in play.", 'Blaze deals X damage to target creature or player.', 'Canopy Spider may block as though it had flying.', 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Change the text of target permanent by replacing all instances of one color word with another or one basic land type with another. (For example, you may change "nonblack creature" to "nongreen creature" or "forestwalk" to "plainswalk." This effect doesn\'t end at end of turn.)', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals his or her hand and discards all cards of that color from it.', 'Choose one Target player gains 3 life; or prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Coastal Tower comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U} to your mana pool.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target instant spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell, then untap up to four lands.', "Creature spells can't be countered.", "Creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.\\nWhenever a creature comes into play, untap all creatures.", "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+5 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all Plains.', "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or land.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target attacking creature. You gain life equal to its power.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target enchantment.', "Destroy target green creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nDraw a card.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated. You gain life equal to its toughness.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Destroy target white creature. It can't be regenerated.\\nDraw a card.", 'Discard a land card from your hand: Seismic Assault deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card from your hand.', "During each player's turn, each other player's spells cost {3} more to play.", 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature in play that shares a creature type with it. (For example, if there are three Goblins in play, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Elfhame Palace comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W} to your mana pool.', "Enchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchanted creature can't be blocked except by Walls.", "Enchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchanted creature gets +2/+1.', "Enchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "Enchanted creature has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", "Enchanted land is a 5/6 green Treefolk creature that's still a land.", "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhen Nekrataal comes into play, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nAttacking doesn't cause Diving Griffin to tap.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nAttacking doesn't cause Serra Angel to tap.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nFirst strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nGoblin Glider can't block.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nNightmare's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nSacrifice Spiketail Hatchling: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Angel of Mercy comes into play, you gain 3 life.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Aven Cloudchaser comes into play, destroy target enchantment.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Aven Fisher is put into a graveyard from play, you may draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Sage Owl comes into play, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhen Vampiric Spirit comes into play, you lose 4 life.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card from his or her hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Blinding Angel deals combat damage to a player, that player skips his or her next combat phase.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Thieving Magpie deals damage to an opponent, you draw a card.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{1}{R}: Two-Headed Dragon gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nTwo-Headed Dragon can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.\\nTwo-Headed Dragon may block an additional creature.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{1}{U}: Return Fleeting Image to its owner's hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\n{W}: Aven Flock gets +0/+1 until end of turn.", 'Forestwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Forest.)', 'G', 'Giant Spider may block as though it had flying.', "Goblin Raider can't block.", 'Guerrilla Tactics deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Guerrilla Tactics from your hand, Guerrilla Tactics deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', 'Hammer of Bogardan deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\n{2}{R}{R}{R}: Return Hammer of Bogardan from your graveyard to your hand. Play this ability only during your upkeep. (Your upkeep step is after you untap and before you draw.)', 'Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)', "Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)\\nAt end of turn, return Viashino Sandstalker to its owner's hand. (Return it only if it's in play.)", 'Haste (This creature may attack the turn it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Lava Hounds comes into play, it deals 4 damage to you.', "Hulking Cyclops can't block.", 'If a source would deal damage to a creature or player, it deals double that damage to that creature or player instead.', 'If a source would deal damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.', 'If target opponent has more cards in hand than you, draw cards equal to the difference.', 'If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.', "If you have 3 life or less, Avatar of Hope costs {6} less to play.\\nFlying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)\\nAvatar of Hope may block any number of creatures.", 'Inferno deals 6 damage to each creature and each player.', "Islands don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player.', "Lhurgoyf's power is equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", 'Lightning Blast deals 4 damage to target creature or player.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', "Maro's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.", 'Mountainwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Mountain.)', 'Nonbasic lands are Mountains.', "Obliterate can't be countered.\\nDestroy all artifacts, creatures, and lands. They can't be regenerated.", "Ogre Taskmaster can't block.", "Okk can't attack unless a creature with greater power also attacks.\\nOkk can't block unless a creature with greater power also blocks.", 'Pay 2 life: Regenerate Deepwood Ghoul.', 'Phantom Warrior is unblockable.', "Phyrexian Colossus doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nPay 8 life: Untap Phyrexian Colossus.\\nPhyrexian Colossus can't be blocked except by three or more creatures.", "Players play with their hands revealed.\\nIf a player would draw a card, he or she reveals it instead. Then any other player may pay 2 life. If a player does, put that card into its owner's graveyard. Otherwise, that player draws the card.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt this turn to up to two target creatures.', "Put two target lands on top of their owner's library.", 'Pyroclasm deals 2 damage to each creature.', 'Pyrotechnics deals 4 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players.', 'R', 'Rain of Blades deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', "Return all creatures to their owners' hands.", "Return all green permanents to their owners' hands.", 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to play.', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Return target green card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Sacrifice Shock Troops: Shock Troops deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "Sacrifice a land: Coastal Hornclaw gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", 'Salt Marsh comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B} to your mana pool.', "Sea Monster can't attack unless defending player controls an Island.", "Search target opponent's library for a creature card and put that card into play under your control. Then that player shuffles his or her library.", 'Search your library for a basic land card and put that card into play tapped. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a blue instant card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'Searing Wind deals 10 damage to target creature or player.', 'Set aside all cards in play. Starting with you, each player chooses one of the cards set aside and puts it into play tapped under his or her control. Repeat this process until all those cards have been chosen.', 'Shivan Oasis comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Sizzle deals 3 damage to each opponent.', "Sneaky Homunculus can't block or be blocked by creatures with power 2 or greater.", "Spineless Thug can't block.", 'Spitting Spider may block as though it had flying.\\nSacrifice a land: Spitting Spider deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', "Spreading Algae can enchant only a Swamp.\\nWhen enchanted land becomes tapped, destroy that land.\\nWhen Spreading Algae is put into a graveyard from play, return Spreading Algae to its owner's hand.", 'Star Compass comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add to your mana pool one mana of any color a basic land you control could produce.', "Sudden Impact deals damage equal to the number of cards in target player's hand to that player.", 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)', "Swarm of Rats's power is equal to the number of Rats you control.", 'Tap an untapped creature you control: Llanowar Behemoth gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. Choose a card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards a card from his or her hand for each Swamp you control.', 'Target player discards two cards from his or her hand.', 'Target player draws two cards.', 'Target player gains X life.', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.', 'Tidal Kraken is unblockable.', 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'U', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.', 'Until end of turn, all lands become 2/2 creatures that are still lands.', "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", 'Urborg Volcano comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R} to your mana pool.', 'Vicious Hunger deals 2 damage to target creature and you gain 2 life.', 'Volcanic Hammer deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'W', "Walls may attack as though they weren't Walls.", 'When Death Pit Offering comes into play, sacrifice all creatures you control.\\nCreatures you control get +2/+2.', 'When Elvish Pioneer comes into play, you may put a basic land card from your hand into play tapped.', 'When Gravedigger comes into play, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Hunted Wumpus comes into play, each other player may put a creature card from his or her hand into play.', 'When Maggot Carrier comes into play, each player loses 1 life.', 'When Merchant of Secrets comes into play, draw a card.', 'When Primeval Force comes into play, sacrifice it unless you sacrifice three Forests.', 'When Ravenous Rats comes into play, target opponent discards a card from his or her hand.', 'When Rukh Egg is put into a graveyard from play, put a 4/4 red Rukh creature token with flying into play at end of turn.', 'When Serpent Warrior comes into play, you lose 3 life.', 'When Staunch Defenders comes into play, you gain 4 life.', 'When Venerable Monk comes into play, you gain 2 life.', 'When Wood Elves comes into play, search your library for a Forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', "When Wrath of Marit Lage comes into play, tap all red creatures.\\nRed creatures don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", 'When you control no other creatures, sacrifice Emperor Crocodile.', 'Whenever City of Brass becomes tapped, it deals 1 damage to you.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Whenever Deathgazer blocks or becomes blocked by a nonblack creature, destroy that creature at end of combat.', 'Whenever Elite Javelineer blocks, it deals 1 damage to target attacking creature.', 'Whenever Fungusaur is dealt damage, put a +1/+1 counter on it. (The damage is dealt before the counter is put on.)', 'Whenever Giant Badger blocks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Lesser Gargadon attacks or blocks, sacrifice a land.', 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', 'Whenever a Forest is tapped for mana, its controller adds {G} to his or her mana pool.', "Whenever a creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, return that creature to its owner's hand. (It won't be affected by the spell or ability.)", "Whenever a creature is dealt damage, destroy it. It can't be regenerated.", "Whenever a creature is put into a graveyard from play, that creature's controller may draw a card.", 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card from his or her hand.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage, you gain that much life.', 'Whenever a creature you control is put into a graveyard from play, each other player sacrifices a creature.', "Whenever a land is put into a graveyard from play, Dingus Egg deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", "Whenever a permanent is returned to a player's hand, that player discards a card from his or her hand.", 'Whenever a player plays a black spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a blue spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a green spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a red spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a player plays a white spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a spell or ability an opponent controls causes a land to be put into your graveyard from play, return that land to play.', 'Whenever an opponent discards a card from his or her hand, Megrim deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, Underworld Dreams deals 1 damage to him or her.', 'Whenever an opponent plays a spell, Mogg Sentry gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever an opponent taps a Mountain for mana, you may gain 1 life.', 'Whenever enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', 'Whenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Whenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds one mana of any color to his or her mana pool.', 'Whenever you play an enchantment spell, you may draw a card.', 'Yavimaya Enchantress gets +1/+1 for each enchantment in play.', "You and target opponent each flip a coin. Mana Clash deals 1 damage to each player whose coin comes up tails. Repeat this process until both players' coins come up heads on the same flip.", "You can't be the target of spells or abilities.", 'You control enchanted artifact.', 'You control enchanted permanent.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You gain 2 life for each creature you control.', 'You gain 3 life for each creature attacking you.', 'You gain 4 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', "You may have Lone Wolf deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", "You may have Rhox deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.\\n{2}{G}: Regenerate Rhox.", "You may have Thorn Elemental deal its combat damage to defending player as though it weren't blocked.", 'Your opponents play with their hands revealed.', "{1}: Return target land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{1}, Discard a land card from your hand: Draw a card.", '{1}: The next time a black source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a blue source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a green source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a red source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', '{1}: The next time a white source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', "{2}, {T}: Target creature gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", '{2}, {T}: Target player puts the top two cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', "{2}{G}{G}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it into play. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", '{2}{U}{U}: Draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Rod of Ruin deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{3}, {T}: Target player discards a card from his or her hand. Play this ability only during your turn.', "{3}, {T}: Target player names a card, then reveals the top card of his or her library. If it's the named card, the player puts it into his or her hand. Otherwise, the player puts it into his or her graveyard and Vexing Arcanix deals 2 damage to him or her.", "{3}: Patagia Golem gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying.)", '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Fodder Cannon deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{4}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{5}, {T}: Return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{6}, {T}: Search your library for a card and put that card into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', "{8}, {T}: Aladdin's Ring deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target opponent reveals his or her hand. Choose a card from it. That player discards that card. Play this ability only any time you could play a sorcery.', '{B}: Looming Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Primeval Shambler gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}: Regenerate Drudge Skeletons.', "{B}{B}, Pay half your life rounded up: Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", '{B}{B}, {T}: Destroy target green creature.', '{B}{B}, {T}: Destroy target white creature.', '{G}, Sacrifice a Forest: Foratog gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Elvish Lyrist: Destroy target enchantment.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Elvish Scrapper: Destroy target artifact.', '{G}, {T}: Put a creature card from your hand into play.', '{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{G}: Regenerate Horned Troll.', '{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature.', '{R}, {T}: Anaba Shaman deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', '{R}: Ridgeline Rager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice Daring Apprentice: Counter target spell.', '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Bloodshot Cyclops deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target creature or player.", '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Draw a card.', "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {3} to your mana pool instead.", "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {2} to your mana pool instead.", "{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {2} to your mana pool instead.", '{T}: Add {G}{G} to your mana pool.', "{T}: All damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn by a source of your choice is dealt to Oracle's Attendants instead.", '{T}: Crossbow Infantry deals 1 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Destroy target Wall.', '{T}: Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Destroy target tapped creature.', '{T}: Draw a card.', '{T}: Elite Archers deals 3 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', "{T}: Look at the top three cards of target player's library. (Put them back in the same order.)", '{T}: Orcish Artillery deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to you.', '{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', '{T}: Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', '{T}: Target permanent becomes the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{U}, {T}: Tap or untap target creature.', "{U}{U}{U}, {T}: Return target permanent to its owner's hand.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{W}: Honor Guard gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', '{W}{W}: Target attacking creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.']
